<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">RRK12.SFM Runyankore-Rukiga Bible Version 1964 lasted edited 06.07.2022</book>
  <para style="h">2 ABAGABE</para>
  <para style="toc1">Ekitabo Ky'abagabe Ekya Kabiri</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Abagabe</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Bag</para>
  <para style="mt1">EKITABO KY'ABAGABE</para>
  <para style="mt2">EKYA KABIRI</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya okuragura aha kufa kw'omugabe Ahazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:2">2 Sam 8:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:5">2 Bag 3:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabu ku yaaherize kufa, Abamoabu baagomera Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mat 10:25</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo Ahazia akooga omu dirisa ey'ekishengye kye ky'ahaiguru omuri Samaria, yaagwa, yaarwara; atyo yaatuma entumwa naazigira ati: Mwirooko, muraguze ahari Baali-zebubi, ruhanga wa Ekurooni, yaaba ndikira egi ndwara. <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:17">21:17</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Eliya owa Tishubi ati: Imuka oinamukye, obugane entumwa z'omugabe wa Samaria, ozigire oti: Ekirikuza kukuragurizisa ahari Baali-zebubi, ruhanga wa Ekurooni, n'ahabw'okuba omuri Israeli tiharimu Ruhanga? <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Mbwenu oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Torikwija kuruga ha kishego ki oriho; buzimazima noija kufa. Atyo Eliya yaazayo.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Ezo ntumwa ku zaagarukire aha mugabe, yaazibuuza ati: Mwagarurwa ki? <verse eid="2KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Baamugarukamu bati: Tubugainwe omushaija, yaatugira ati: Mwirooko mugarukye aha mugabe obatumire, mumugire muti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Ekirikuza kukuragurizisa ahari Baali-zebubi, ruhanga wa Ekurooni, n'ahabw'okuba omuri Israeli tiharimu Ruhanga? N'ahabw'ekyo torikwija kuruga ha kishego eki oriho; buzimazima noija kufa. <verse eid="2KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Yaababuuza ati: Ni muntu ki obabugaine, akabagambira ebigambo ebyo? <verse eid="2KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:4">Zek 13:4</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:4">Mat 3:4</ref>. </char></note> Baamugarukamu bati: Abaire ajwaire ekijwaro ky'ebyoya, ayezirikiise orukoba. Onu yaagira ati: Ni Eliya owa Tishubi. <verse eid="2KI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Bwanyima omugabe yaamutumaho omukuru w'engabo makumi ataano hamwe n'ezo ngabo ze. Yainamuka, yaashanga Eliya ashutami aha mutwe gw'ekibungo, yaamugira ati: Iwe mushaija wa Ruhanga 'we, omugabe naakugira ngu oshuume. <verse eid="2KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:54">Luk 9:54</ref>. </char></note> Eliya yaagarukamu ogwo mukuru w'engabo ataano ati: Ku ndaabe ndi omushaija wa Ruhanga, omuriro nigurugye omu iguru, gukumareho n'engabo zaawe makumi ataano. Ahonaaho omuriro gwaruga omu iguru, gwamumaraho n'engabo ze makumi ataano.<verse eid="2KI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaamutumaho ondiijo mukuru w'engabo makumi ataano hamwe n'engabo ze. Yainamuka, yaamugira ati: Iwe mushaija wa Ruhanga 'we, ekiragiro ky'omugabe nikigira kiti: Shuuma ahonaaho. <verse eid="2KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 1:16">Yob 1:16</ref>. </char></note> Eliya yaabagarukamu ati: Ku ndaabe ndi omushaija wa Ruhanga, omuriro gurugye omu iguru, gukumareho n'engabo zaawe makumi ataano. Ahonaaho omuriro gwa Ruhanga gwaruga omu iguru, gwamumaraho n'engabo ze makumi ataano.<verse eid="2KI 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 26:21">1 Sam 26:21</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 72:14">Zab 72:14</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe yaagaruka yaatuma ondiijo mukuru w'engabo makumi ataano obwa kashatu hamwe n'ezo ngabo ze. Ogwo mukuru w'engabo wa kashatu yainamuka, yaashanga Eliya, yaamutsimbira amaju, yaamweshengyereza naagira ati: Ai bambe, iwe mushaija wa Ruhanga 'we, ninkweshengyereza, reka amagara gangye n'ag'abairu baawe makumi ataano gabe ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Reeba, omuriro gurugire omu iguru, gwamaraho abakuru b'engabo abambandiize hamwe n'engabo zaabo makumi ataano-ataano; kwonka mbwenu reka amagara gangye gabe ag'obuguzi bwingi omu maisho gaawe. <verse eid="2KI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />Bwanyima maraika wa MUKAMA yaagira Eliya ati: Shuuma nawe; otamutiina. Atyo yaimuka, yaashuuma nawe aha mugabe, <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Waaza kutuma entumwa kukuragurizisa ahari Baali-zebubi, ruhanga wa Ekurooni, omuri Israeli habaire hatarimu Ruhanga w'okwehanuuzaho? Ahabw'ekyo torikwija kuruga aha kishego eki oriho; buzimazima noija kufa.<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Atyo omugabe yaafa, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki Eliya yaagambire oku kyabaire kiri. Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoraamu mwene Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda, Yehoraamu omurumuna yaaba omugabe omu mwanya gwe, ahabw'okuba Ahazia ogwo akaba ataine mutabani. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ei Ahazia yaakozire tehandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli?<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Eliya okutwarwa omu iguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:19-21">1 Bag 19:19-21</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 5:24">Kut 5:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> MUKAMA ku yaabaire ari haihi kutwara Eliya omu iguru n'omuyaga gw'akasooroora, Eliya na Elisa bakaba bari omu muhanda nibaruga Gilugaali. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="RUT 1:15">Rus 1:15</ref>, <ref loc="RUT 1:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Eliya yaagira Elisa ati: Ninkweshengyereza, guma aha; ahakuba MUKAMA yantuma Beseeli. Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, kandi ninkurahira, tindikwija kukurugaho. Batyo baashuuma, baaza Beseeli. <verse eid="2KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:1">2 Bag 4:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 4:38">38</ref>. </char></note> Abaana ba baanabi, abaabaire bari Beseeli, baashohora, baashanga Elisa, baamugira bati: Noomanya ku eri izooba MUKAMA arikwija kutwara mukama waawe, akamukwihaho? Onu ati: Eego ninkimanya; kwonka, nimwetsize.<verse eid="2KI 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Eliya yaagira Elisa ati: Elisa, ninkweshengyereza guma aha, ahakuba MUKAMA yantuma Yeriko. Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, kandi ninkurahira, tindikwija kukurugaho. Batyo baahika Yeriko. <verse eid="2KI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Abaana ba baanabi abaabaire bari Yeriko, bairirira Elisa, baamugira bati: Noomanya ku eri izooba MUKAMA arikwija kutwara mukama waawe, akamukwihaho? Yaagarukamu ati: Eego, ninkimanya; kwonka nimwetsize.<verse eid="2KI 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Bwanyima Eliya yaamugira ati: Ninkweshengyereza guma aha; ahakuba MUKAMA yantuma Yorudani. Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, kandi ninkurahira, tindikwija kukurugaho. Batyo baagumizamu bombi. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Abashaija makumi ataano ab'omu baana ba baanabi nabo baagyenda, baabeemerera hangahari, nibareeba Eliya na Elisa beemereire aha rubaju rwa Yorudani. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 14:21">Kur 14:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 3:16">Yos 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:19">1 Bag 19:19</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Eliya yaajuura omunagiro gwe, yaagukubamu, yaateera amaizi; ahonaaho amaizi gaayecwamu habiri oku n'oku, bombi baayambukira ahoomire.<verse eid="2KI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Ku baaherize kwambuka, Eliya yaagira Elisa ati: Shaba eki ndaakukorere, ntakakwihirweho. Elisa yaagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza, ndaga emigabo ebiri y'omwoyo gwawe. <verse eid="2KI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Onu yaagira ati: Waashaba ekigumire; kwonka ku orandeebe ninkwihwaho, noija kukitunga; ku oraabe otandeebire, tikirikwija kuba kityo. <verse eid="2KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17">2 Bag 6:17</ref>. </char></note> Ku baabaire nibakigyenda nibagaaniira, ahonaaho haija ekigaari ky'omuriro n'embaraasi z'omuriro, byabataanisa. Eliya yaatwarwa omuyaga gw'akasooroora, yaatemba omu iguru. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:14">2 Bag 13:14</ref>. </char></note> Elisa ku yaakireebire, yaagamba munonga, naagira ati: Taata! Taata! Ebigaari bya Israeli n'embaraasi zaayo! Tiyaagaruka kumureeba. Ahonaaho yaakwata ebijwaro bye, yaabitaaguramu ebicweka bibiri. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Bwanyima yaihaho omunagiro gwa Eliya ogwamuragara, yaagarukayo, yaayemerera aha rubaju rwa Yorudani. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Yaakwata ogwo munagiro gwa Eliya ogwamuragara, yaateera amaizi naagira ati: MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Eliya, arahi? Ku yaateire amaizi, gaayebaganisamu habiri, yaayambuka.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Abaana ba baanabi abaabaire bari Yeriko, ku baamureebire abari omu maisho, baagira bati: Omwoyo gwa Eliya guri ahari Elisa. Baija kumubugana, baamwinamira; <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:12">1 Bag 18:12</ref>. </char></note> baamugira bati: Reeba, itwe abairu baawe twine abashaija b'amaani makumi ataano; nitukweshengyereza, ka bagyende, basherure mukama waawe. Obundi Omwoyo wa MUKAMA akaaba amukiriize, amunagire omu kibungo nari omu ruhanga ahatarikumanywa. Onu ati: Mutabatuma. <verse eid="2KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Kwonka ku baamweshengyereize munonga, yaarugaho yaakwatwa enshoni, yaabagira ati: Mubatume. Batyo baatuma abashaija makumi ataano, baamara ebiro bishatu nibamusherura, tibaamubona. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Ku baamugarukireho, baashanga akiri Yeriko, yaabagira ati: Timbagizire nti: Mutagyenda?<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa okushemeza amaizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Abashaija b'orwo rurembo baagira Elisa bati: Reeba Mukama waitu, naiwe nk'oku orikureeba, ahu orurembo rwombekirwe ni harungi, kwonka amaizi gaaho ni mabi, n'eitaka ryaho tiririkweza. <verse eid="2KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Yaagira ati: Mundeetere akaabya kasya, mukatemu omwonyo. Batyo bakamureetera. <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 15:25">Kur 15:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:41">2 Bag 4:41</ref>. </char></note> Yaaza aha nshuro y'amaizi, yaaginagamu omwonyo, yaagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Naatambira aga maizi; okuruga hati tigakirugwamu rufu nari okutorooga. <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />N'ahabw'ekyo ago maizi gaashemera okwiha obwo n'okuhitsya eri izooba, nk'ekigambo eki Elisa yaagambire oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Yaarugayo, yainamuka, yaaza Beseeli; ku yaabaire naakigyenda, haija abatsigazi bato nibaruga omu rurembo, baamugaaniiza nibagira bati: Iwe mushaija w'oruhara 'we, inamuka! Iwe mushaija w'oruhara 'we, inamuka! <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 13:25">Neh 13:25</ref>. </char></note> Yaahinduka; ku yaabareebire, yaabakyeena omu iziina rya MUKAMA; ahonaaho haija edubu ibiri z'enkazi zaaruga omu kibira, zaabataagataaguramu abatsigazi makumi ana na babiri. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">1 Bag 18:19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 18:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho yaagumizamu, yaaza aha kibungo kya Karumeeli; yaarugayo, yaagaruka Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa okutambira eihe ry'Abaisraeli eiriho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Bag 16:31</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 10:26">2 Bag 10:26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana gw'omu busingye bwa Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda, Yehoraamu mwene Ahabu akaba omugabe wa Israeli omuri Samaria, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka ikumi n'ebiri. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, n'obu araabe atarabaire mubi nka ishe na nyina; ahakuba akihaho enyomyo ya Baali, ei ishe yaakozire. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:28-32">1 Bag 12:28-32</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:16">14:16</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka yaagumira omu kibi kya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, eki yaasiisiise Abaisraeli; tiyaakireka.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Mesha omugabe wa Moabu akaba ari omworozi w'entaama. Buri mwaka akaba aragiirwe kuha omugabe wa Israeli abaana b'entaama akasiriira. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:1">2 Bag 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Ahabu ku yaafiire, omugabe wa Moabu yaagomera omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />N'ahabw'ekyo omugabe Yehoraamu yaaruga Samaria omu bunaku obwo, yaateerana Abaisraeli boona kuhurura. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 22:4">1 Bag 22:4</ref>. </char></note> Yaagyenda, yaatuma ahari Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda, naamugira ati: Omugabe wa Moabu angomeire; noikiriza kuhurura naanye, tukateera Moabu? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, niinyija kuhurura; nyowe naiwe turi bamwe; abantu bangye nibo baawe, n'embaraasi zangye nizo zaawe. <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Tutoore guuha nituhurura? Yehoraamu yaamugarukamu ati: Tutoore ogw'eihamba rya Edomu.<verse eid="2KI 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaahurura n'omugabe wa Yuda n'owa Edomu. Ku baaherize orugyendo rw'ebiro mushanju nibeekiikuura, haabura amaizi g'eihe n'obu gaakuba ag'enyamaishwa ezi baagyenzire nazo. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Omugabe wa Israeli nikwo kugira ati: Ai bambe! MUKAMA atureetsire twenshatu kutuhayo omu mikono y'Abamoabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:21">1 Bag 19:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:7">22:7</ref>. </char></note> Yehoshafaati yaamubuuza ati: Aha tihariho nabi wa MUKAMA, ou twakwehanuuzaho ahari MUKAMA. Omwe aha bagaragwa b'omugabe wa Israeli yaagarukamu ati: Aha hariho Elisa mwene Shafati, owaabaire anaabisa Eliya engaro. <verse eid="2KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Yehoshafaati yaagira ati: Ekigambo kya MUKAMA kiri omuriwe. Atyo omugabe wa Israeli yaashuuma ahari Elisa hamwe na Yehoshafaati n'omugabe wa Edomu.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">3:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:19">1 Bag 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:6">22:6</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:3">Ezk 14:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Elisa yaagira omugabe wa Israeli ati: Nyine kakwate ki naiwe? Irooko oyehanuuze ahari baanabi ba sho n'aha ba nyoko. Omugabe wa Israeli yaagira ati: Ngaaha! MUKAMA niwe atuhurwize twenshatu, ngu atuheyo omu mikono y'Abamoabu. <verse eid="2KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 5:16">2 Bag 5:16</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaagira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA ow'amahe, ou mpeereza, kuri ntaagirira Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda eshoni, tinkukucwire ryera, n'obu kwakuba okukureeba. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:46">1 Bag 18:46</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 1:3">Ezk 1:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 3:14">3:14</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 3:22">22</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka mbwenu mundeetere omuteezi w'enanga. Omuteezi w'enanga ku yaagiteire, amaani ga MUKAMA gaamwijaho. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Yaagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nari: Niinyija kwijuza omukura ogu ogwomire amaizi. </char></note>Mwijuze oru ruhanga emikura; <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Timurikwija kureeba muyaga n'obu yaakuba enjura, kwonka oru ruhanga nirwija kwijura amaizi, mubone kunywa, n'ente zaanyu n'enyamaishwa zaanyu. <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Ekyo n'ekigambo kikye ahari MUKAMA; kandi naija kuhayo n'Abamoabu omu mikono yaanyu; <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />kandi nimwija kucwekyereza orurembo rwona oruriho orugo orwehinguririziibwe orugo rw'amabaare, n'orurembo rwona orurungi, kandi muteme omuti gwona omurungi, mwigare enshuro zoona ez'amaizi, mushiishe omusiri gwona omurungi n'amabaare. <verse eid="2KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39-42">Kur 29:39-42</ref>. </char></note> Ku bwaseesire, omu bunaku bw'okuhayo ekitambo, ahonaaho amaizi gaija nigaruga Edomu, ensi yaijura amaizi.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Abamoabu boona ku baahuriire ngu abo bagabe baizire kurwana nabo, baahuruza boona abaabaire nibabaasa kujwara eby'okurwanisa, okwiha aha muto okuhika aha mukuru, baayemerera aha mwatano. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Ku baimukire kare omu kasheeshe, eizooba ryarasha aha maizi, Abamoabu baareeba amaizi omu maisho gaabo nigatukura nk'eshagama. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Baagira bati: Eriya n'eshagama; buzimazima abo bagabe barwaine, baitana. Mbwenu imwe Abamoabu, murahukye tuze kunyaga. <verse eid="2KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Kwonka ku baahikire omu rusiisira rw'Abaisraeli, Abaisraeli baimuka baabarwanisa, okuhitsya obu baabahungire; bakagyenda nibabaita, bakarugaho bakahika n'omu nsi yaabo. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Baasheenya endembo, kandi omusiri gwona omurungi buri muntu yaagunagamu eibaare rye, okuhitsya obu baagishwekire yoona; baigara buri nshuro y'amaizi, baatema emiti yoona emirungi, okuhitsya obu aha ndembo z'amabaare haatsigaire Kiruhareseesi yonka; bwanyima ab'enjungu baagigota, baagicwekyereza. <verse eid="2KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Omugabe wa Moabu ku yaareebire orugamba nirumugyendera kubi, yaatwara abashaija magana mushanju abarikurwanisa zaarurara, ngu baataguze bahikye omugabe wa Edomu; kwonka tibaabaasa. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 2:1">Amo 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:7">Mik 6:7</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaatwara omutabani ow'omujigaijo, owaabaire naaza kumuhungurira kuza aha ngoma, yaamutambira aha mutwe gw'orugo rw'amabaare kuba ekitambo ekyokize. Kyareetera abantu okugirira Abaisraeli ekiniga kingi; baamurugaho, baagaruka omu nsi yaabo.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Elisa okutambira omufaakazi eibanja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 25:39-41">Lev 25:39-41</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 2:3">2 Bag 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:1-6">Neh 5:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:25">Mat 18:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo omwe ahari bakaamwana ba baanabi akatakira Elisa, naagira ati: Omwiru waawe ibanye akafa; kandi noomanya ku omwiru waawe yaabaire atiina Ruhanga; kwonka orikwihuza aizire kutwara abaana bangye bombi kuba abahuuku be. <verse eid="2KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Elisa yaamubuuza ati: Mbwenu nooyenda ku nkukorera ki? Ngambira eki otungire omuka. Onu ati: Omuzaana waawe taine ki atungire, kureka ecupa emwe y'amajuta. <verse eid="2KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Elisa yaagira ati: Irooko oze omuri bagyenzi baawe boona, otiizemu ecupa ezirimu busha, kwonka zitari nkye. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Bwanyima ogarukye omuka, oyekingirane n'abatabani baawe, oshukye ago majuta omuri ezo ecupa zoona; eraijure, ogibiikye. <verse eid="2KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Atyo yaamurugaho, yaayekingirana n'abatabani, baamureetera ecupa, yaazishukamu. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Ecupa zoona ku zaaherize kwijura, yaagira omutabani ati: Ndeetera endiijo. Yaamugira ati: Tihakiriho ndiijo. Ahonaaho amajuta gaarekyeraho kwija. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Yaija yaagambira omushaija wa Ruhanga; nawe yaamugira ati: Irooko otunde ahari ago majuta, oihure amabanja gaawe; bwanyima iwe n'abatabani baawe mutungwe agaraatsigareho.<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ebyomukazi wa Shuneemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 25:3">1 Sam 25:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Eizooba rimwe Elisa akaimuka, yaaza Shuneemu, ei omukazi omutungi yaabaire atwire; omukazi ogwo yaamugyemesereza kurya eby'okurya. Okwiha obwo, ku yaabaire arabayo, ahungukayo kurya ak'okurya. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Ogwo mukazi yaagira iba ati: Mbwenu nyetegyereize ogu mushaija orikuturabaho obutoosha ku ari omushaija orikwera wa Ruhanga. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Ka tumwombekyere akashengye kakye aha mutwe gw'enju, tumuteeremu ekitanda, emeeza, entebe n'etabaaza; ku araagume yaatuhungukaho, abe nimwo yaaza.<verse eid="2KI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Eizooba rimwe akahungukayo, yaaza omuri ako kashengye, yaahuumuriramu. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 5:20">2 Bag 5:20</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 5:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 5:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:4">8:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 8:5">5</ref>. </char></note> Yaagira Gehazi omuheereza we ati: Nyetera ogwo mukazi wa Shuneemu. Ku yaamwetsire, yaayemerera omu maisho ge. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisa yaagira Gehazi ati: Mugire oti: Mbwenu, obu otufeereire kubi oti, tukaakukorera ki? Nooyenda ku tugira eki twakugambirira omugabe, nari omukuru w'amahe? Ogwo mukazi yaagarukamu ati: Ngaaha! Ndi omu baitu. <verse eid="2KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Elisa yaabuuza ati: Mbwenu shi, ekindi tumukorere ki? Gehazi yaagarukamu ati: Manya taine mwana w'omwojo, kandi na iba n'omugurusi. <verse eid="2KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Elisa yaagira ati: Mwete. Ku yaamwetsire, ogwo mukazi yaayemerera omu muryango. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 18:14">Kut 18:14</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaamugira ati: Omu bunaku nk'obu omu mwaka ogurikwija oryakiikira omwana w'omwojo. Onu ati: Ngaaha, mukama wangye, iwe mushaija wa Ruhanga 'we, reka kubeiha omuzaana waawe. <verse eid="2KI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Bwanyima ogwo mukazi yaabaka enda, yaazaara omwana w'omwojo omu bunaku nk'obwo omu kutandika kw'omwaka, nk'oku Elisa yaamugambiire.<verse eid="2KI 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Ogwo mwana ku yaakuzire, eizooba rimwe yaaza kureeba ishe omu bagyesi. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Yaagira ishe ati: Ai bambe! Omutwe gwanyita! Omutwe gwanyita! Ishe yaagira omuhuuku we ati: Mutwarire nyina. <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Ku yaamuheekire, yaamutwarira nyina, omwana yaamushutama aha bibero okuhitsya omu ihangwe, yaakaba. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Nyina yainamuka, yaamurambika aha kitanda ky'omushaija wa Ruhanga, yaamukingirana, yaashohora. <verse eid="2KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Yaayeta iba, yaamugira ati: Nyoherereza omwe aha bambari baawe, n'endogoya emwe, ngyende ahonaaho nze ow'omushaija wa Ruhanga, ngarukye. <verse eid="2KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 28:11">Kub 28:11</ref>. </char></note> Iba ati: Ekirikukuhuuta owe eri izooba niki? Okwezi tikukabonekire, kandi ti sabato. Onu ati: Ni kirungi nzeyo. <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Atyo yaatandiika endogoya, yaagira omwambari we ati: Irukanzya endogoya; oteetwara ntakugambiire. <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:25">2 Bag 2:25</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaagyenda yaahika aha mushaija wa Ruhanga aha kibungo Karumeeli. Ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga ku yaamureebeire hare naakiija, yaagira Gehazi omuheereza we ati: Reeba, oriya ga n'omukazi ori owa Shuneemu; <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />gyenda noiruka, omubugane, omubuuze oti: ni buhooro? Baro ari buhooro? N'omwana waawe ari buhooro? Omukazi yaamugarukamu ati: Ni buhooro. <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Ku yaahikire aha mushaija wa Ruhanga omu kibungo, yaayaija kumutsindika. Kwonka omushaija wa Ruhanga yaagira ati: Murekye, ahakuba omutima gwe gwine enaku nyingi; kandi MUKAMA akinsherekire, tiyaakingambira. <verse eid="2KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Omukazi yaamugira ati: Niinye naashabire mukama wangye omwana w'omwojo? Tindakugizire nti: Otambeiha? <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:19">Kur 7:19</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 14:16">14:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:4">Luk 10:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 19:12">Byak 19:12</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaagira Gehazi ati: Yezirikye, otware enkoni yangye, ogyende. Ku oraabugane omuntu, otamuramutsya; kandi ku haraagire owaakuramutsya, omwetsize; orambikye egi nkoni aha maisho g'omwana. <verse eid="2KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Nyina w'omwana yaamugira ati: Nindahira MUKAMA, kandi ninkurahira, tindikwija kukutsiga aha. Atyo yaimuka, yaamukuratira. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 11:11">Yoh 11:11</ref>. </char></note> Gehazi yaagyenda abeebembeire, yaarambika egyo nkoni aha maisho g'omwana; tihaabaho kateezo n'obu kwakuba okwetengyetsa. Nikyo yaagarukiireyo kumubugana, akamugira ati: omwana tiyaahimbuuka.<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Elisa ku yaatahire omu nju, yaareeba omwana abyami aha kitanda kye afiire. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 17:20-23">1 Bag 17:20-23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:6">Mat 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:25">9:25</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaataahamu, yaayekingiranamu n'omwana, yaashaba MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Bwanyima yaaza aha kitanda, yaayegororera aha mwana, yaata omunwa aha munwa gwe, n'amaisho aha maisho ge, n'engaro aha ngaro ze; ku yaamwegororeireho, omubiri gw'omwana gwatandika kutagata. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:10">Byak 20:10</ref>. </char></note> Yaagaruka yaimuka, yaagyendagyendaho omu nju rimwe, yaagaruka yaaza aha kitanda, yaamwegororeraho, omwana yaayetsyamura emirundi mushanju, yaabuuruura amaisho. <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Yaayeta Gehazi, yaamugira ati: Yeta ogwo mukazi wa Shuneemu. Atyo yaamweta. Ku yaamuhikire, yaagira ati: Ihaho omwana waawe. <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:1-6">2 Bag 8:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 11:35">Heb 11:35</ref>. </char></note> Yaija, yaagwa aha bigyere bye, yaajuumara ahansi, yaihaho omwana we, yaashohora.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Elisa okushemesa emboga z'abaana ba baanabi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Bwanyima Elisa yaagaruka Gilugaali; kandi hakaba hateireyo enjara. Abaana ba baanabi ku baabaire bamushutami omu maisho, yaagira omuheereza we ati: Ta enyungu mpango aha mahega, oteekyere abaana ba baanabi ekicumbe. <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Omwe aharibo yaaza omu ishwa kushoroma emboga, yaashangayo omutanga, yaagushoromaho entanga, yaaziijuza omwenda gwe, yaija, yaazikyeka, yaazita omu nyungu eri ey'ekicumbe, atazimanyire. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Batyo baihura kugaburira abantu. Kwonka ku baabaire nibarya ekyo kicumbe, baagamba munonga nibagira bati: Ai bambe, mushaija wa Ruhanga, omu nyungu harimu rufu. Tibaabaasa kukirya. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:41: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:21">2 Bag 2:21</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaagira ati: Mureete esaano. Yaaginaga omu nyungu, yaagira ati: Mwihurire abantu, barye. Baashanga omu nyungu hatakirimu kabi.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:42: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 14:16-21">Mat 14:16-21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 15:32-38">15:32-38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Haija omushaija naaruga Baali-shaliisha, areeteire omushaija wa Ruhanga eby'okurya by'omuganuro, emigaati ya sayiri makumi abiri n'enshaho y'obushiisha bubisi bw'engano. Elisa yaagira omuheereza we ati: Gaburira abantu, barye. <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Kwonka ogwo muheereza yaagira ati: Ebi nimbaasa nta kubigaburira abashaija igana? Elisa yaagaruka yaamugambira ati: Bigaburire abantu, barye; ahakuba oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nibaija kurya, batsigazeho. <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Atyo yaabibata omu maisho, baarya, ebindi byatsigaraho, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ebya Naamani omubembe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 4:27">Luk 4:27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Naamani omukuru w'eihe ry'omugabe wa Siria akaba ari omushaija orikusiimwa munonga mukama we, ahabw'okuba ahabwe MUKAMA akaha Abasiria okusingura. Kandi akaba ari omushaija rugambwa emanzi, kwonka akaba ari omubembe. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Omu hururu emwe Abasiria bakahurura omu nsi ya Israeli, baanyagayo omwishiki muto, yaaguma naaheereza muka Naamani. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Eizooba rimwe yaagira mugore we ati: Mukama wangye ku yaakuza owa nabi ow'omuri Samaria! Akaamutambira ebibembe bye. <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Atyo Naamani yaataahamu, yaagambira mukama we ati: Omwishiki ori owaanyagirwe omu nsi ya Israeli yaagira ati n'ati. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:8">2 Bag 8:8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 8:9">9</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Siria yaamugira ati: Mbwenu irooko, ogyende, niinyija kutwekyera omugabe wa Israeli ebaruha. Naamani yaagyenda, yaatwara etalanta z'efeeza ikumi, na shekeli z'ezaabu enkumi mukaaga, n'ebijwaro eby'okwihaihanisa ikumi. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Atyo yaatwarira omugabe wa Israeli ebaruha, erikugira eti: Ebaruha egi ku eraakuhikye, reeba naakwoherereza omushaija wangye Naamani, omutambire ebibembe. <verse eid="2KI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Omugabe wa Israeli ku yaashomire ebaruha, yaataagura ebijwaro bye naagira ati: Niinye Ruhanga orikwita akakiza, omushaija ogu okuntumaho ngu ntambire omuntu ebibembe? Muteekateekye, mureebe ku arikutaara ah'okutonganira naanye.<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Kwonka Elisa omushaija wa Ruhanga, ku yaahuriire ngu omugabe wa Israeli ataagwire ebijwaro bye, yaamutumaho naagira ati: Ahabw'enki otaagwire ebijwaro byawe? Murekye anyijeho hati, abone kumanya omuri Israeli ku harimu nabi. <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Atyo Naamani yaija, n'embaraasi ze n'ebigaari bye, yaayemerera aha muryango gw'enju ya Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 9:7">Yoh 9:7</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaamutumaho entumwa naagira ati: Irooko oze omuri Yorudani, oyogyemu emirundi mushanju, omubiri gwawe nigwija kuba nk'oku gwabaire guri, nooshemera. <verse eid="2KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Naamani ku yaakihuriire, yaaguubwa kubi, yaagyenda naagira ati: Nyowe mbaire ningira ngu buzimazima naija kushohora, nampikaho, naayeta eiziina rya MUKAMA Ruhanga we, naasiisirira aharwaire, nantambira ebibembe. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Emigyera ya Damasiko, Abana na Faapa, terikuhita amaizi goona ag'omuri Israeli? Tinkubaasize kwoga omuri ago, nkashemera? Atyo yaakuba yaagarukayo agwirwe kubi munonga. <verse eid="2KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Abaheereza be baamwirira haihi, baamugira bati: Taata, kuri nabi ogu yaakuragiira ekintu kihango, tokukikozire? Kaashwa okukugira ati: Yoga, oshemere? <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Atyo yaashuuma, yaayejabika omuri Yorudani emirundi mushanju, nk'ekigambo ky'omushaija wa Ruhanga oku kyabaire kiri; omubiri gwe gwaba nk'ogw'omwana muto, yaashemera.<verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Bwanyima yaagaruka ahari ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga, we n'abantu be boona, yaija, yaayemerera omu maisho ge, yaamugira ati: Mbwenu naamanya ku hatabaho Ruhanga omu nsi yoona kureka omuri Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo ninkweshengyereza yakiira omukimbo gw'omwiru waawe. <verse eid="2KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 14:23">Kut 14:23</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Nindahira Ruhanga otahwaho, ou mpeereza, tindikwija kugira kintu kyona eki naayakiira. Yaamweshengyereza kukitwara, onu yaayanga. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Naamani yaagira ati: Ku oraabe waayanga, ninkweshengyereza, nyowe omwiru waawe, mpeebwe eitaka eririkwekorerwa enyumbu ibiri; ahabw'okuba okuruga hati tindikwija kutamba kitambo ky'okwotsya nari ekindi kitambo ahari ruhanga ondiijo weena, kureka MUKAMA wenka. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Omu kigambo eki MUKAMA agume asaasire omwiru waawe; mukama wangye ku ariguma yaaza omu nju ya Ramoni okuramizamu, naanye nainama omuri egyo nju, nainama omu nju ya Ramoni, MUKAMA asaasire omwiru waawe omu kigambo ekyo. <verse eid="2KI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisa yaamugira ati: Gyenda n'obusingye.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="2KI 5:19">Gehazi okubeiha, akabemba</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 5:19">Kwonka Naamani ku yaabaire yaamurugaho akaanya kakye, <verse eid="2KI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:12">2 Bag 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Gehazi omuheereza wa Elisa omushaija wa Ruhanga yaagira ati: Mbwenu mukama wangye Elisa yaayangire kutwara eki ogu Musiria Naamani yaamureetera. Nindahira MUKAMA, naaza kwiruka, ngire eki naamwihaho. <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Atyo Gehazi yaakurata Naamani. Naamani ku yaareebire omuntu amukuratiire, yaaruga omu kigaari kumubugana, yaagira ati: Ni buhooro? <verse eid="2KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Onu ati: Ni buhooro. Mukama wangye yantuma kukugambira naagira ati: Omuri aka kaanya haija abatsigazi babiri abaana ba baanabi, nibaruga omu nsi y'ebibungo eya Efuraimu; mbwenu ninkweshengyereza obampeere etalanta y'efeeza, kandi n'ebijwaro bibi by'okwihaihanisa. <verse eid="2KI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Naamani yaamugira ati: Ikiriza, otware etalanta ibiri. Atyo yaamweshengyereza, yaamukomera etalanta z'efeeza ibiri omu nshaho ibiri, n'ebijwaro bibiri by'okwihaihanisa, yaabikorera abairu be babiri, baagyenda beebembeire Gehazi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Gehazi ku yaahikire aha kabungo k'owaabo, yaabibaihaho, yaabitaasya omu nju; yaaboohereza, baagyenda. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Yaatahamu, yaayemerera omu maisho ga mukama we. Elisa yaamubuuza ati: Waaba ogiire hi, Gehazi? <verse eid="2KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Omwiru waawe taine hu yaaba agiire. Elisa yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Omutima gwangye tigwagyenda naiwe, obu omushaija yaaruga omu kigaari kukubugana? Noogira ngu obwo nibwo bwaba buri obunaku bw'okwakiiriramu empiiha, ebijwaro, emisiri y'emizeituuni n'ey'emizaabibu, entaama, ente, abahuuku n'abazaana? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 12:10">Kub 12:10</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo ebibembe bya Naamani byaza kukwomaho iwe n'oruzaaro rwawe ebiro byona. Atyo yaamuruga omu maisho abembire naayera nk'orubaare.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Eky'okutangaaza ky'okutuuhuura empango omu maizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Bwanyima abaana ba baanabi baagira Elisa bati: Reeba, omwanya ogu tutwiremu, ogu orikuturebereramu, ni mukye, tugufunziremu. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Ka tuze Yorudani, buri muntu atemeyo enyomyo, twekorereyo omwanya gw'okutuuramu. Yaabagarukamu ati: Nimwirooko! <verse eid="2KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Bwanyima omwe yaamushaba naagira ati: Ikiriza ogyende n'abairu baawe. Yaamugarukamu ati: Eego, niinyija kugyenda. <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Atyo yaagyenda nabo. Ku baahikire Yorudani, baatema emiti. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Kwonka omwe ku yaabaire naatema, empango yaakuuka, yaagwa omu maizi; yaayamuza ati: Ai bambe, Mukama wangye! Ebaire eri entiizano. <verse eid="2KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Omushaija wa Ruhanga yaamubuuza ati: Yaagwa hi? Ku yaamworekire omwanya, yaatema akati, yaakanagaho, etyo yaatuuhuuka. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Yaagira ati: Giihemu. Yaagikununkirira, yaagiihamu.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ruhanga okworeka omuheereza wa Elisa eihe ry'omu iguru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Omugabe wa Siria ku yaabaire naarwanisa Israeli, yaahanuura n'abashaija be naagira ati: Omu mwanya nanka na nanka nimwo ndita orusiisira rwangye. <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Omushaija wa Ruhanga yaatuma aha mugabe wa Israeli naagira ati: Oyerinde, otaraba omu mwanya nanka, ahabw'okuba Abasiria niyo barikushuuma kukugwera. <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Omugabe wa Israeli yaatuma omuri ogwo mwanya ogu omushaija wa Ruhanga yaamugambiire. Okwo nikwo Elisa yaabaire ateisa omugabe, akakira ti rimwe, kandi ti kabiri. <verse eid="2KI 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Ekyo kyareetera omugabe wa Siria kwemereza omutima munonga, yaayeta abashaija be, yaabagira ati: Timukaanyoreka omuntu omuriitwe ori aha rubaju rw'omugabe wa Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Omwe aha bashaija be yaagira ati: Ngaaha, Mukama wangye omugabe; kureka Elisa nabi ow'omuri Israeli niwe agambira omugabe wa Israeli ebigambo ebi ogambira omu kishengye eki oraaramu. <verse eid="2KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Yaamugira ati: Irooko oreebe ei ari, ntumeyo bamukwate. Baamugira bati: Manya, ari Dosani. <verse eid="2KI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Atyo yaatumayo embaraasi n'ebigaari n'eihe rihango, baahikayo nyekiro, baagota orurembo.<verse eid="2KI 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Omuheereza w'omushaija wa Ruhanga ku yaimukire kare omu kasheeshe, yaashohora, yaareeba eihe n'embaraasi n'ebigaari byehinguririize orurembo. Ogwo muheereza yaagira ati: Ai bambe Mukama wangye! Mbwenu tugire tuta? <verse eid="2KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:7">2 Bus 32:7</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 8:31">Rom 8:31</ref>. </char></note> Onu yaagira ati: Otatiina; ahabw'okuba abari hamwe naitwe ni baingi okukira abo abari hamwe nabo. <verse eid="2KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 2:11">2 Bag 2:11</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 34:7">Zab 34:7</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 68:17">68:17</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Elisa yaashaba naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza, mwigure amaisho, areebe. Atyo MUKAMA yaigura amaisho g'ogwo mutsigazi, yaareeba; kandi reeba ogwo mugongo gukaba gwijwire embaraasi n'ebigaari by'omuriro byehinguririize Elisa. <verse eid="2KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 19:11">Kut 19:11</ref>. </char></note> Abasiria ku baahikire Elisa, yaashaba MUKAMA naagira ati: Ninkweshengyereza humya amaisho g'aba bantu. Atyo MUKAMA yaahumya amaisho gaabo, nk'oku Elisa yaamushabire. <verse eid="2KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Elisa yaabagira ati: Ogu tigwo muhanda, kandi oru tirwo rurembo. Munkuratire, mbatwarire omushaija ou murikusherura. Yaabeembera, yaabahitsya Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Ku baataahire bati omuri Samaria, Elisa yaashaba ati: Ai MUKAMA, humuura amaisho g'aba bashaija, bareebe. MUKAMA yaahumuura amaisho gaabo, baareeba; ku baagiire kureeba, baashanga bari ahagati ya Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Omugabe wa Israeli ku yaabareebire, yaabuuza Elisa ati: Taata, mbaite? Mbaite? <verse eid="2KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 12:20">Rom 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaagarukamu ati: Otabaita. Nooyenda kwita abu oyekwatiire na rurara n'obuta bwawe? Bahe eby'okurya n'amaizi, barye, banywe, bagarukye ahari mukama waabo. <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Atyo yaabateekyera eby'okurya bingi; ku baaherize kurya n'okunywa, yaaboohereza, baagaruka ahari mukama waabo. Emitwe y'engabo z'Abasiria yaarekyera aho kuguma neija kuteera ensi ya Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Abasamaria okugotwa Abasiria n'okwitwa enjara</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Bwanyima Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria yaateeranira hamwe eihe rye ryona, yainamuka, yaateera Samaria, yaagigota. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Enjara nyingi yaateera Samaria ahabw'okugotwa, okuhitsya obu omutwe gw'endogoya gwaguzire shekeli z'efeeza makumi munaana, na kimwe kya kana ky'akaabya k'amaizi g'enkombe kikagura shekeli z'efeeza itaano. <verse eid="2KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Eizooba rimwe omugabe wa Israeli ku yaabaire naahingura aha mutwe gw'orugo rw'amabaare, omukazi yaamutakira naagira ati: Njuna, Mukama wangye omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Onu yaagira ati: MUKAMA ku araabe atakujunire, nyowe niinyiha hi eby'okukujuna? Mbiihe aha mbuga y'okuhuuriraho nari omu inyuukiro rya viinyo? <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Omugabe yaamubuuza ati: Obaire ota? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Omukazi ogu angizire ati: Reeba mutabani waawe, tumurye eri izooba, nyencakare turye owangye. <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:29">Lev 26:29</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:55-57">Bir 28:55-57</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 5:10">Ezk 5:10</ref>. </char></note> Tutyo twateeka omwana wangye, twamurya. Ku buseesire, naamugira nti: Reeta omwana waawe tumurye; mbwenu owe amusherekire. <verse eid="2KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo by'ogwo mukazi, yaataagura ebijwaro bye (obwo omugabe akaba naahingura ari aha mutwe gw'orugo rw'amabaare; abantu ku baamureebire, baashanga abandize ekiguniya aha mubiri gwe). <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Omugabe yaagira ati: Eizooba ku riraarengye Elisa mwene Shafati akiine omutwe, Ruhanga akinture n'okukiraho.<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:4">1 Bag 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:13">21:13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Obwo Elisa akaba ashutami omu nju ye, n'abakuru bashutami hamwe nawe. Omugabe yaamutumaho entumwa omu bu yaabaire aine; kwonka egyo ntumwa ku yaabaire etakahikireyo, Elisa yaagira abo bakuru ati: Nimureeba oku ogwo mwitsi yaatuma kuncwaho omutwe? Mbwenu egyo ntumwa ku eraije, mukingye orwigi, murugumyeho engaro, erekye kutaahamu. Emitsindo ya mukama we temuri enyima? <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Ku yaabaire naakigamba nabo, omugabe yaashuuma, yaamuhikaho, yaagira ati: Ezi naku zirugire ahari MUKAMA. Mbwenu nkimwiniireho ki amatsiko?<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="s1">Abasiria okuhungisibwa obwoba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Kwonka Elisa yaagira ati: Muhurire ekigambo kya MUKAMA. Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Nyencakare nk'aga magingo encuro y'esaano y'obunono neija kugura shekeli, emwe, n'encuro ibiri za sayiri zigure shekeli emwe, aha irembo rya Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Omukuru w'engabo, ou omugabe yaabaire ayegamira omukono gwe yaagira omushaija wa Ruhanga ati: Noogira ngu n'obu MUKAMA wenka yaakuta amadirisa omu iguru, ekigambo eki kikaabaho? Onu ati: Noija kukireeba n'amaisho gaawe, kwonka torikwija kubiryaho.<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ababembe okugarura amakuru marungi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 13:46">Lev 13:46</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi obwo hakaba hariho abashaija bana ababembire bari aha irembo; baagambirana bonka bati: N'enki ekitushutamiise aha, okuhitsya obu turaafe? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Ahakuba ku turaagire tuti, Ka tutaahe omu rurembo, orurembo rurimu enjara nitwija kugwamu; kandi hoona n'obu turaagume tushutami aha, nabwo nitwija kufa. N'ahabw'ekyo mwije twambukye twegyeme orusiisira rw'Abasiria; ku baraaturekye, tugumeho; ku baraatwite, biri twafiire. <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Batyo baimuka omu rwita-waabo kuza omu rusiisira rw'Abasiria. Ku baahikire ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, baashanga hatarimu muntu; <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:17">2 Bag 6:17</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba MUKAMA akaba areeteire engabo z'Abasiria kuhurira okuhinda kw'ebigaari n'embaraasi, n'endigito y'eihe rihango, kyabareetera kugambirana bati: Yeimwe, omugabe wa Israeli aguririire abagabe b'Abahiiti n'ab'Abanyamisri kututeera. <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PRO 28:1">Enf 28:1</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baimuka omu rwita-waabo, baacwa, baatsigaho amahema gaabo, embaraasi zaabo n'endogoya zaabo, orusiisira rwona nk'oku rwabaire ruri, baahunga ngu bakize amagara. <verse eid="2KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Abo babembe ku baahikire ahu orusiisira rurikutandikira, baataaha omu ihema rimwe, baarya, baanywa, baihamu efeeza n'ezaabu n'ebijwaro, baagyenda, baabishereka; baagaruka baataaha omu rindi ihema, baihamu ebindi, baagyenda, baabishereka.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Bwanyima baagambirana bati: Ebi turikukora tibihikire. Eizooba eri n'eizooba ry'amakuru marungi, haza tuhunami; ku turaarekye bukataagurukana, nitwija kugiibwaho ekiheneso. N'ahabw'ekyo mwije tugyende, tugambire ab'omu nju y'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Batyo baagyenda; ku baahikire aha irembo, baayeta omurinzi w'eirembo, baamugira bati: Twahika omu rusiisira rw'Abasiria, twashanga rutarimu muntu n'obu kaakuba akateezo, kureka embaraasi n'endogoya zitsibikire, kandi n'amahema gari nk'oku gabaire gari. <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Ogwo murinzi yaayeta abandi, baabigambira ab'omu nju y'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Omugabe yaimuka nyekiro, yaagambira abaheereza be ati: Ka mbagambire enaama ei Abasiria batugiriire. Bamanyire ku enjara etwitsire; nikyo barugiire omu rusiisira, bakeeshereka omu ishwa, nibateekateeka bati: Ku baraashohore omu rurembo, nitwija kubagurukana, tubakwate bahuriire, tweshukye n'omu rurembo. <verse eid="2KI 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Omwe aha baheereza be yaagira ati: Ka batware embaraasi itaano ahari ezo ezitsigaire omu rurembo; mbwenu torikumanya ku zirembire nk'Abaisraeli boona abatsigaire omu rurembo, abahonokire ahari abo abafiire; tutumeyo, tureebe. <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Baareeta abashaija babiri b'embaraasi, omugabe yaaboohereza kukurata eihe ry'Abasiria, naagira ati: Mugyende mureebe. <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Baabakurata okuhika Yorudani, baashanga omuhanda gwona gwijwire ebijwaro n'ebintu ebi Abasiria banagire nibairuka. Ezo ntumwa zaagaruka zaagambira omugabe.<verse eid="2KI 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 7:1">2 Bag 7:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima abantu baashohora, baanyaga orusiisira rw'Abasiria. N'ahabw'ekyo encuro y'esaano y'obunono yaagura shekeli emwe, n'encuro eibiri za sayiri zaagura shekeli emwe, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="2KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 6:32">2 Bag 6:32</ref>. </char></note> Eryo izooba omugabe yaaragiira omukuru w'engabo, ou yaabaire ayegamira omukono, kurinda eirembo. Abantu baamuribatiiririra omu irembo, yaafa, nk'oku omushaija wa Ruhanga agambire, obu omugabe amwizireho. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Ahakuba omushaija wa Ruhanga ku yaagambiire omugabe ati: Nyencakare nk'aga magingo, encuro ibiri za sayiri niziija kugura shekeli emwe, n'encuro y'esaano y'obunono egure shekeli emwe omu irembo rya Samaria, <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />ogwo mukuru w'engabo yaagarukamu omushaija wa Ruhanga naagira ati: Noogira ngu n'obu MUKAMA wenka yaakuta amadirisa omu iguru, ekigambo eki kikaabaho? Onu yaamugira ati: Noija kukireeba n'amaisho gaawe, kwonka torikwija kubiryaho. <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Kyaba nikwo kyamubaho kityo; ahabw'okuba abantu bakamuribatiiririra omu irembo, yaafa.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'Elisa n'omukazi wa Shuneemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 41:27">Kut 41:27</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 4:35">2 Bag 4:35</ref>; <ref loc="HAG 1:11">Hag 1:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Elisa akaba agambiire omukazi, ou yaazoire omwana we ati: Imuka ogyende, iwe n'ab'eka yaawe, oshuhuukire ahu orikubaasa hoona; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA aragiire enjara kuteera, kandi neija kumara omu nsi emyaka mushanju. <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Omukazi yaimuka, yaakora nk'oku omushaija wa Ruhanga yaamugambiire; yaagyenda n'ab'eka ye, yaashuhuukira omu nsi y'Abafilistia okumara emyaka mushanju. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Emyaka mushanju ku yaahweire, ogwo mukazi yaagaruka naaruga omu nsi y'Abafilistia, yaaza owa omugabe kumwetongyeza ahabw'enju ye n'obutaka bwe. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:12">2 Bag 4:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi obwo omugabe akaba naagaaniira na Gehazi omuheereza w'omushaija wa Ruhanga, naagira ati: nteekyerereza ebikuru byona ebi Elisa yaakozire. <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:35">2 Bag 4:35</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire naakiteekyerereza omugabe oku Elisa yaahimbwire ofiire, omukazi ou yaahimbwire omutabani, yaija yaayetongyeza omugabe ahabw'enju ye n'obutaka bwe. Gehazi yaagira ati: Mukama wangye omugabe, ogu niwe mukazi n'ogu niwe mutabani ou Elisa yaahimbwire. <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Kandi omugabe ku yaabuurize ogwo mukazi, nawe yaabimushobororera. Atyo omugabe yaamukwatsa omwe aha batware be, yaamugira ati: Omugarurire ebye byona, n'ebyayezire omu misiri ye okwiha obu yaaruga omuri egi nsi n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Benihadadi, na Hazaeli okurya obugabe bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 6:24">2 Bag 6:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Elisa yaaza Damasiko. Omu bunaku obwo Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria akaba arwaire; baamugira bati: Omushaija wa Ruhanga ori yaija. <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:2">2 Bag 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:15">19:15</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 19:17">17</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira Hazaeli ati: Twara omukimbo, obugane ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga, omushabe, akubuurize ahari MUKAMA, naagira ati: Ebyo omugabe naija kukira egi ndwara? <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Atyo Hazaeli yaaza kumubugana, aine omukimbo gw'ebintu by'emiringo yoona ebya Damasiko, ebirikwekorerwa engamira makumi ana. Ku yaamuhikire, yaayemerera omu maisho ge, yaagira ati: Omwana waawe Benihadadi omugabe wa Siria yaakuntumaho naabuuza ati: Niinyija kukira egi ndwara? <verse eid="2KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:14">2 Bag 8:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 8:15">15</ref>. </char></note> Elisa yaamugarukamu ati: Irooko omugire oti: Buzima egyo ndwara noija kugikira. Kwonka kandi MUKAMA anyorekire ngu, buzima naija kufa. <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Yaamugumyaho eriisho, okuhitsya obu yaakwatsirwe enshoni. Omushaija wa Ruhanga yaarira. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:32">2 Bag 10:32</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:17">12:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:3">13:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:7">7</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 13:16">Hos 13:16</ref>. </char></note> Hazaeli yaamubuuza ati: Mukama wangye, noorizibwa ki? Yaagarukamu ati: Ahabw'okuba nimmanya oku orikora kubi Abaisraeli; ebigo byabo oryabyotsya n'omuriro, abatsigazi baabo oryabaitsa rurara, oryateera ahansi abaana baabo, bacwagagurikye, n'abakazi baabo abaine enda obashature aha nda. <verse eid="2KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 19:15">1 Bag 19:15</ref>. </char></note> Hazaeli yaagira ati: Mbwenu nkaanye omwiru waawe embwa, niinye oha okukora ekigambo ekyo ekikuru? Elisa yaamugarukamu ati: MUKAMA anyorekire ku orikwija kuba omugabe wa Siria. <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:10">2 Bag 8:10</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaaruga ahari Elisa, yaija ahari mukama we; mukama we yaamubuuza ati: Elisa yaakugambira ki? Onu yaamugarukamu ati: Yangira ngu buzima noija kukira. <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Kwonka ku bwaseesire, yaakwata eky'okweshweka, yaakijabika omu maizi, yaakimuta aha maisho okuhitsya obu yaafiire. Bwanyima yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Omu mwaka gwa kataano ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoramu mwene Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, Yehoraamu mwene Yehoshafaati omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:17-24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:5-10">2 Bus 21:5-10</ref>. </char></note> Yaaza aha ngoma ahikize emyaka makumi ashatu n'ebiri, yaategyekyera emyaka munaana omuri Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Yaagyendera omu mitwarize y'abagabe ba Israeli, nk'ab'enju ya Ahabu oku baakozire, ahabw'okuba akashwera muhara wa Ahabu. Kandi yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:36">1 Bag 11:36</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA tarenzire kuhwerekyereza Yuda ahabwa Daudi omwiru we, nk'oku yaaraganiise kuguma naamuha etabaaza n'oruzaaro rwe ebiro byona.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Omu biro bye Abanyaedomu bakagoma, baaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda, baayeteeraho omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Bwanyima Yehoraamu yaayambuka, yaaza Zairi n'ebigaari bye byona. Yaimuka nyekiro, we n'abakuru b'ebigaari bye baateera Abanyaedomu, abaabaire bamwehinguririize; kandi engabo ze zoona zaahunga, zaataaha. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 27:40">Kut 27:40</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 10:29">Yos 10:29</ref>, <ref loc="JOS 10:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo Edomu yaagomire, ekaruga omu butegyeki bwa Yuda n'okuhitsya hati. Omu bunaku obwo Libuna nayo yaagoma. <verse eid="2KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yehoraamu n'ebi yaakozire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:20">2 Bus 21:20</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:12">4:12</ref>. </char></note> Yehoraamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa hamwe na baishenkuru omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Ahazia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoramu mwene Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli, Ahazia mwene Yerohaamu omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahazia akaba ahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka. Yaategyekyera omwaka gumwe omuri Yerusaalemu; kandi eiziina rya nyina akaba ari Atalia, mwijukuru wa Omuri omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Nawe yaagyendera omu mitwarize y'ab'enju ya Ahabu, yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ab'enju ya Ahabu oku baakozire; ahabw'okuba akaba ari mukwe w'ab'enju ya Ahabu.<verse eid="2KI 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">8:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 22:3">1 Bag 22:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaahurura na Yoramu mwene Ahabu kurwanisa Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria omuri Ramosi-gileadi. Abasiria baahutaarizayo Yoramu. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:15">2 Bag 9:15</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:16">16</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Yoramu yaagaruka Yezereeli kurwarizibwayo obuhuta obu Abasiria baamuhutaariize Raama, obu yaarwana na Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria. Kandi Ahazia mwene Yehoraamu omugabe wa Yuda yaashuuma kureeba Yoramu mwene Ahabu omuri Yezereeli, ahabw'okuba akaba arwaire.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s1">Yehu okuba omugabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:16">1 Bag 19:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Elisa nabi yaayeta omwe aha batabani ba baanabi, yaamugira ati: Yezirikye, otware eri ihembe ry'amajuta, oze Ramosi-gileadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Ku oraahikyeyo, osherure Yehu mwene Yehoshafaati, mwijukuru wa Nimushi; ku oraamanye omu ari, otaahemu, omwimutsye omuri beene ishe, omutware omu kishengye ky'omunda. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Bwanyima okwate eri ihembe ry'amajuta, ogamushukye aha mutwe, ogire oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Naakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli. Ku oraaheze, oigure orwigi, ohungye, oteeziringa.<verse eid="2KI 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Atyo ogwo mutsigazi nabi yaagyenda, yaaza Ramosi-gileadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Ku yaahikireyo, yaashanga abakuru b'eihe nibahanuura; yaagira ati: Nyine obutumwa ahariiwe, Omukuru w'engabo. Yehu yaamubuuza ati: Ahari oha omuriitwe twena? Yaamugarukamu ati: Ahariiwe, Omukuru w'engabo. <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:7">2 Bus 22:7</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Yehu yaimuka, baataaha omu nju; ogwo mutsigazi yaamushuka amajuta aha mutwe, naamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Naakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe w'eihanga rya MUKAMA Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:4">1 Bag 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:5-15">21:5-15</ref>. </char></note> Oryaita ab'enju ya Ahabu mukama waawe, mbone kuhoora Yezebeeli enzigu y'eshagama y'abairu bangye baanabi, kandi n'eshagama y'abandi bairu ba MUKAMA boona. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:21">1 Bag 21:21</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 10:17">2 Bag 10:17</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ab'enju ya Ahabu boona nibaija kuhwerekyerera, mmare ahari Ahabu oyetwa omushaija weena, omuhuuku nari ow'obusingye, omuri Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:10">1 Bag 14:10</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:3">16:3</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyahindura enju ya Ahabu nk'eya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, kandi nk'eya Baasha mwene Ahiya. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1 Bag 21:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 9:35">2 Bag 9:35</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:36">36</ref>. </char></note> Embwa ziryariira Yezebeeli omu kibanja kya Yezereeli, abure owaamuziika. Ahonaaho yaigura orwigi, yairuka.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JHN 10:20">Yoh 10:20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yehu yaashohora, yaagaruka aha bashaija ba mukama we, baamubuuza bati: Ni buhooro? Ogwo mushaija omugwairaro yaaba areetsirwe ki ahariiwe? Yaabagarukamu ati: Ogwo mushaija nimumumanya n'ebigambo bye. <verse eid="2KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Baagira bati: Ngaaha, noobeiha; tugambire amazima. Onu ati: Yaagamba naanye naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Naakushukaho amajuta kuba omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:8">Mat 21:8</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baarahuka, buri muntu yaakwata ekijwaro kye, baabyara ahansi ye aha mutwe gw'amatembero, baateera eikondere nibagira bati: Yehu yaaba omugabe.<verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu okwita Yoramu na Ahazia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:17">1 Bag 19:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:28">2 Bag 8:28</ref>. </char>
    </note> Oku nikwo Yehu mwene Yehoshafaati mwijukuru wa Nimushi, yaagomeire Yoramu. (Omu bunaku obwo Yoramu n'Abaisraeli boona bakaba nibarinda Ramosi-gileadi Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria; <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 8:29">2 Bag 8:29</ref>. </char></note> kwonka omugabe Yoramu akaba agarukire Yezereeli kurwarizibwayo obuhuta obu Abasiria baamuhutaize, obu yaarwana na Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria.) Atyo Yehu yaagira ati: Eki ku muraabe nikyo murikwenda, hatagira omuntu weena owairuka kuruga omu rurembo, kutwara enkuru omuri Yezereeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Atyo Yehu yaatemba ekigaari, yaaza Yezereeli, ahakuba Yoramu niyo yaabaire arwariire; kandi obwo Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda akaba ashuumireyo kureeba Yoramu.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Obwo omurinzi akaba ayemereire aha munaara gw'omuri Yezereeli, naareebera hare omutwe gw'engabo za Yehu nigwija; yaagira ati: Nindeeba omutwe gw'engabo nigwija. Yoramu yaagira ati: Tuma omuntu aha mbaraasi ababugane, ababuuze ati: Ni buhooro? <verse eid="2KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Atyo ow'aha mbaraasi yaaza kumubugana, yaagira ati: Omugabe naabuuza ngu, Ni buhooro? Yehu yaagira ati: Ebya buhooro noofa ki nabyo? Hingura, okubuukye, onkurate. Ogwo murinzi yaagira ati: Entumwa yaabahika, kwonka tindikureeba neegaruka. <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Omugabe yaagaruka yaatuma ondiijo aha mbaraasi; nawe yaabahika, yaabagira ati: Omugabe naabuuza ngu, Ni buhooro? Yehu yaagarukamu ati: Ebya buhooro, noofa ki nabyo? Hingura, okubuukye, onkurate. <verse eid="2KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Omurinzi yaagaruka yaagira ati: Nawe yaabahika, kwonka tindikureeba naagaruka. Kandi emivugire neeshusha eya Yehu mwene Nimushi, ahakuba naavugisa amaani.<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 21:1">1 Bag 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 22:7">2 Bus 22:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoramu yaagira ati: Muboneze ekigaari kyangye. Baakiboneza. Yoramu omugabe wa Israeli na Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda baashohora, buri omwe omu kigaari kye, baaza kubugana Yehu, baamubugana aha kibanja kya Nabosi owa Yezereeli. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 21:13">2 Bus 21:13</ref>. </char></note> Yoramu ku yaareebire Yehu, yaamubuuza ati: Ni buhooro, Yehu? Onu yamugarukau ati: Ni buhooro ki, obushambani bwa nyoko Yezebeeli, n'oburugo bwe bikiri bingi biti? <verse eid="2KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Yoramu yaahinduza embaraasi orukoba, yaahunga, naagira Ahazia ati: Ahazia, hariho okureebyana! <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Yehu yaananuura obuta bwe n'amaani ge goona, yaateera Yoramu omwambi omu buteeraniro bw'amabega, gwamwata omutima, gwayogamu, yaagwa omu kigaari kye <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">1 Bag 21:19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:29">29</ref>. </char></note> Yehu yaagira Bidukaari omukuru w'engabo ze, ati: Mukirize, omunagye omu musiri gw'ekibanja kya Nabosi owa Yezereeli; ahakuba noijuka, obu nyowe naiwe twakurata Ahabu ishe, turi aha mbaraasi, MUKAMA akamuraguraho ekigambo eki ati: <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />Buzimazima, nk'oku nyomwabazyo ndeebire eshagama ya Nabosi n'abatabani, naanye ndyakuhoorera omuri ogu musiri; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira. N'ahabw'ekyo mukirize, omunagye omuri ogwo musiri, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire.<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">9:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 22:9">2 Bus 22:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda ku yaakireebire, yaahungira omu muhanda ogurikuza Besi-hagani. Yehu yaamubinga, naagira ati: Nawe mumurashe. Baamurasira omu kigaari kye yaahika aharikweinamuka Guuri, eri haihi na Ibuleamu. Yaahungira Megido, yaagwayo. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Abagaragwa be baamuta omu kigaari, baamutwara Yerusaalemu, baamuziika omu kituuro omu rurembo rwa Daudi, baamushangisa baishenkuru. <verse eid="2KI 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Kandi omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoramu mwene Ahabu, Ahazia akatandika kutegyeka Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yezebeeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Yehu ku yaahikire Yezereeli, Yezebeeli yaakihurira, yaaziga amaisho ge, yaaboneza eishokye rye, yaaringuririza omu dirisa. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:9-20">1 Bag 16:9-20</ref>. </char></note> Yehu ku yaabaire yaahika ati omu rurembo, Yezebeeli yaamugira ati: Iwe Zimuri, owaita mukama waawe, ni buhooro? <verse eid="2KI 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Yehu yaimutsya amaisho, yaareeba omu dirisa, yaagira ati: Ori aha rubaju rwangye n'oha? N'oha? Abakonwa bashatu nari babiri baamuringuriza. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Yaabagira ati: Mumunagye ahansi. Batyo baamunaga ahansi, eshagama ye yaataraakira ekisiika n'embaraasi, zaamuribatiirira. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Bag 16:31</ref>. </char></note> Yehu yaataaha omu nju, yaarya, yaanywa; bwanyima yaagira ati: Mwirooko mureebe ogwo mukazi okyeenirwe, mumuziikye, ahakuba ni muhara w'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Kwonka ku baagiire kumuziika, tibaamushangaho, kureka empanga y'omutwe gwe n'ebigyere n'ebiganja. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:23">1 Bag 21:23</ref>. </char></note> Ku baagarukire, baamugambira, yaagira ati: Ekyo nikyo kigambo kya MUKAMA, eki yaagambire naaraba omu mwiru we Eliya owa Tishubi, ati: Omu musiri gwa Yezereeli nimwo embwa ziririira omutumbi gwa Yezebeeli; <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />kandi omutumbi gwe guryaba nk'amasha agari ahansi omu musiri gwa Yezereeli, habure owaagira ati: Ogu ni Yezebeeli.<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s1">Enju ya Ahabu okuhwerekyerezibwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Kandi Ahabu akaba aine abatabani makumi mushanju omuri Samaria. Yehu yaahandiika ebaruha, yaazitwekyera abategyeki b'orurembo Samaria, n'abakuru baarwo, kandi n'abarezi ba beene Ahabu, naabagira ati: <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />Egi baruha ku eraabahikye eti, nk'oku mwine batabani ba mukama waanyu, kandi mukagira ebigaari n'embaraasi n'endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare n'eby'okurwanisa, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />mutoorane omuri batabani ba mukama waanyu orikukira abandi boona, kandi ohikire, mumute aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa ishe, murwanirire enju ya mukama waanyu. <verse eid="2KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Kwonka baatiina munonga, baagira bati. Ku araabe atabaasiibwe abo bagabe bombi, itwe nitubaasa tuta kumuza omu kaso? <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Atyo omutegyeki w'ekikaari n'ow'orurembo hamwe n'abakuru n'abo barezi b'abaana, baatuma ahari Yehu nibagira bati: Turi abairu baawe; nitwija kukora ebi oraaturagiire byona; kandi titwine muntu weena ou turaayemekye; kureka iwe okore eki orikusiima. <verse eid="2KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Yaagaruka yaabahandiikira ebaruha ya kabiri, naagira ati: Ku muraabe muri abangye, kandi mweteekateekire kuunyorobera, mutemeho batabani ba mukama waanyu emitwe, nyencakare nk'aga magingo muginshangise Yezereeli. Obwo bunaku batabani b'omugabe boona makumi mushanju bakaba bari hamwe n'abakuru b'orurembo, abaabaire nibabarera. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:21">1 Bag 21:21</ref>. </char></note> Egyo baruha ku yaabahikire, baakwata batabani b'omugabe, baabaita boona makumi mushanju, emitwe yaabo baagita omu bitukuru, baagimutwekyera Yezereeli. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Entumwa yaija, yaamugira eti: Emitwe y'abaana b'omugabe baagireeta. Yaagira ati: Mugirunde ebirundo bibiri aha irembo egumeho okuhitsya omu kasheeshe. <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:14">2 Bag 9:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 9:24">24</ref>. </char></note> Omu kasheeshe ku yaashohoire, yaayemerera omu maisho g'abantu boona, yaabagira ati: Imwe timwine rubanja; niinye ngomeire mukama wangye, nkamwita; mbwenu nimugira ngu oitsire aba boona, n'oha? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:19">1 Bag 21:19</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:21">21</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 21:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 3:19">1 Sam 3:19</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo mumanye ku hatariho kigambo na kimwe eki MUKAMA yaagambire aha nju ya Ahabu ekiribura; ahabw'okuba MUKAMA ahikiriize eki yaagambire naaraba omu mwiru we Eliya. <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Bwanyima Yehu yaita boona abaabaire batsigaire omu nju ya Ahabu omuri Yezereeli, abashaija be ab'aha mara, n'abanyamurwa be; tiyaatsigaho na waakizira.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Bwanyima Yehu yaarugayo, yaaza Samaria; ku yaabaire akiri omu muhanda, yaahika aha nju y'eikyemuriro ry'ebyoya by'entaama, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 22:8">2 Bus 22:8</ref>. </char></note> yaabugana ab'oruganda rwa Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda, yaabuuza ati: Muri baahi? Baamugarukamu bati: Turi ab'oruganda rwa Ahazia, twizire kutaayaayira abaana b'omugabe n'aba nyin'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Yaagira ati: Mubakwate bahuriire. Baabakwata bahuriire, baabaitira aha kiina ky'enju y'eikyemuriro ry'ebyoya by'entaama, boona makumi ana na babiri, tiyaatsigaho n'omwe.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yehu okurwanisa aba Baali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 2:55">1 Bus 2:55</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:6-10">Yer 35:6-10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 35:14">14</ref>, <ref loc="JER 35:16">16</ref>, <ref loc="JER 35:18">18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ku yaarugire aho, yaabugana Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu, aizire kumubugana, yaamuramutsya, yaamubuuza ati: Omutima gwawe ni mwere, nk'oku ogwangye guri mwere ahariiwe? Yehonadabu yaamugarukamu ati: Nikwo guri. Onu ati: Ku guraabe nikwo guri, mpa engaro. Atyo yaazimuha. Onu yaamutembya omu kigaari; <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />yaamugira ati: Ija tugyende, oreebe obweziriki bwangye ahabwa MUKAMA. Atyo yaamutwara omu kigaari kye. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Ku yaahikire Samaria, yaita aba Ahabu boona abaabaire batsigaire Samaria, okuhitsya obu yaabamazireho, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA, eki yaagambiire Eliya, oku kyabaire kiri.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:18: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:31">1 Bag 16:31</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:32">32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yehu yaateeranira hamwe abantu boona, yaabagira ati: Ahabu akaheereza Baali mpora, kwonka Yehu naija kumuheereza munonga. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:19">1 Bag 18:19</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:6">22:6</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati muunyetere baanabi ba Baali boona, boona abarikumuramya, n'abanyamurwa be boona, hatagira n'omwe owaaburaho; ahabw'okuba nyine ekitambo kihango ky'okutambira Baali; weena oraabureho tarikwija kugumaho. Kwonka Yehu ekyo akakikoresa obwengye oburimu obugobya, ngu abone kucwekyereza abarikuramya Baali. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Yehu yaaragiira ati: Murangye, habeho okuteerana okurikwera ahabwa Baali. Batyo baakuranga. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:32">1 Bag 16:32</ref>. </char></note> Yehu yaatuma omuri Israeli yoona; abaabaire nibaramya Baali boona baija, tihaagira muntu n'omwe owaatsigarayo ataizire. Baataaha omuri nyaruju ya Baali, yaijura n'aha bunwa. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Yehu yaagambira orikutegyeka enju erikubikwamu ebijwaro, ati: Reetera abaramya Baali boona ebijwaro. Atyo yaabibareetera. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Bwanyima Yehu yaataaha omuri nyaruju ya Baali na Yehonadabu mwene Rekabu, yaagambira abarikuramya Baali ati: Mwetegyereze, muhamye ngu omuriimwe tiharimu mwiru wa MUKAMA, kureka abarikuramya Baali bonka. <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Atyo yaataahamu kuhayo ebitambo n'okutamba ebitambo by'okwotsya. Kwonka Yehu akaba ataire aheeru abashaija makumi munaana, yaabagira ati: Omuntu oraikirize omwe ahari aba, abu naata omu mikono yaanyu, kubura, naamuzira. <verse eid="2KI 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaaherize ati kutamba ekitambo ky'okwotsya, yaagira abarinzi n'abakuru b'engabo ati; Mutaahemu, mubaite, hatagira n'omwe owaacwa. Batyo baabaitsa rurara; bwanyima abarinzi n'abakuru b'engabo baabanaga aheeru, baataaha omu kishengye ky'omunda omuri nyaruju ya Baali, <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">1 Bag 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:2">2 Bag 3:2</ref>. </char></note> baashohoza enyomyo ezaabaire ziri omuri nyaruju ya Baali, baazootsya. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Baayatagura ekishushani kya Baali, baasheenyagura nyaruju ye, baagihindura orubungo n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Okwo nikwo Yehu yaamazireho Baali, akamwiha omuri Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:28-31">1 Bag 12:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:16">14:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka Yehu tararekire kukora bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli, nibyo bishushani by'enyana eby'ezaabu ebyabaire biri Beseeli na Daani. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:35">2 Bag 10:35</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:1">13:1</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:10">10</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:23">14:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:8">15:8</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagira Yehu ati: Ahabw'okukora gye, okahikiiriza ebirikusiimwa omu maisho gangye, okagira enju ya Ahabu nk'oku naabaire ninteekateeka omu mutima gwangye kugigira, abaana baawe baryashutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe bwa Israeli okuhitsya aha busingye bwa kana. <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Kwonka Yehu tiyaayeta aha kugyendera omu biragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli n'omutima gwe gwona; tiyaaruga mu bibi ebi Yeroboamu yaakoreise Abaisraeli, bakacumura.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">10:32: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:17">1 Bag 19:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:25">13:25</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:25">14:25</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo MUKAMA yaatandika kutuubya ensi ya Israeli. Hazaeli yaabasingura omu myatano ya Israeli yoona, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />okutandikira Yorudani nootoora oburugwa-izooba, ensi yoona eya Gileadi, n'ey'Abagaadi, n'ey'Abareubeni, n'ey'Abamanaase, okuruga Aroeri, ey'omu ruhita rwa Arunooni, niyo Gileadi na Bashani. <verse eid="2KI 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Endiijo mirimo ya Yehu n'ebi yaakozire byona, n'eby'amaani ge goona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Bwanyima Yehu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika Samaria. Yehoahazi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Kandi emyaka ei Yehu yaamazire aha ngoma naategyeka Israeli omuri Samaria ekahika makumi abiri na munaana.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s1">Atalia nyin'omugabe okucwekyereza abaana b'omutabani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 8:26">2 Bag 8:26</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 22:10-12">2 Bus 22:10-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atalia nyina wa Ahazia ku yaareebire omutabani yaafa, yaimuka, yaacwekyereza abanyiginya boona. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:21">2 Bag 11:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:1">12:1</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka Yehosheba muhara w'omugabe Yehoraamu, munyaanya wa Ahazia, yaatwara Yoasi mutabani wa Ahazia, yaamwiha omuri batabani b'omugabe, abu baabaire nibenda kwita, yaamucwisa n'omurezi we, yaabata omu kishengye ky'okuraaramu. Atyo yaamushereka Atalia, tiyaitwa; <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />yaaguma nawe asherekirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA okumara emyaka mukaaga; obwo Atalia naategyeka ensi.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okwemekwa kwa Yoasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 23:1-21">2 Bus 23:1-21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omu mwaka gwa mushanju Yehoyaada yaatuma abakuru b'Abakariiti n'ab'abarinzi b'engabo igana-igana, yaaragiira ku bamushanga omu nju ya MUKAMA; yaaragaana nabo endagaano, kandi yaabarahiriza omu nju ya MUKAMA; ku yaaherize, yaabooreka omwana w'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 9:25">1 Bus 9:25</ref>. </char></note> Yaabaragiira, naabagira ati: Oku nikwo muraatwaze. Kimwe kya kashatu kyanyu, abaija aha murimo ahari Sabato, barinde enju y'omugabe; <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />kimwe kya kashatu ekindi kize aha irembo rya Suuri; kandi ekindi kigume aha irembo enyima y'abarinzi; <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />ebyo bicweka byanyu byombi, eby'abaihwa aha murimo, birinde enju ya MUKAMA beehinguririize omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Mutyo mugume mukiikiize omugabe embaju zoona, buri muntu akwaitse eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro. Omuntu weena oraayende kutaaha omu mishorongo yaanyu, mumwite. Imwe mugume n'omugabe yaaba naashohora, kandi yaaba naataaha. <verse eid="2KI 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Abakuru b'engabo baakorabyona ebi Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaragiira, buri omwe yaareeta abashaija be ab'okwija aha murimo ahari Sabato, hamwe n'ab'okwihwa aha murimo ahari Sabato, baija ahari Yehoyaada omunyamurwa. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 8:7">2 Sam 8:7</ref>. </char></note> Omunyamurwa yaaheereza abo bakuru b'engabo amacumu n'engabo ebyabaire biri eby'omugabe Daudi bibiikirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA; <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />abarinzi baayemerera, buri muntu akwaitse eby'okurwanisa bye omu ngaro, okuruga aha rubaju rw'enju rw'obukiizi-bwa-buryo, okuhika aha rwa bumosho, beehinguririize eitambiro n'enju. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 31:18">Kur 31:18</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaashohoza omwana w'omugabe, yaamujweka ekirunga aha mutwe, yaamuha Eby'okuhamya; baamuranga ku yaaba omugabe, baamushukaho amajuta, baateera omu ngaro nibagira bati: Omugabe naakaramaare!<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Atalia ku yaahuriire orwari rw'abarinzi n'abantu, yaataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA ahu abantu bari; <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:3">2 Bag 23:3</ref>. </char></note> ku yaanagire amaisho, yaareeba omugabe ayemereire aha rubaju rw'enyomyo, nk'oku omugyenzo gwabaire guri, n'abakuru b'engabo n'ab'amakondere bamwemereire aha rubaju, n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi nibashemererwa, nibateera amakondere. Ahonaaho Atalia yaataagura ebijwaro bye, naagira ati: Okwebumba! Okwebumba! <verse eid="2KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaaragiira abakuru b'engabo abaabaire nibategyeka eihe, naagira ati: Mumurabye omu ngabo, mumushohoze; oraamukurate weena, mumwite na rurara. Ahabw'okuba omunyamurwa akagira ngu arekye kwitirwa omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Batyo baamutaho engaro, baamurabya omu irembo ry'embaraasi, baamuhitsya ahari nyaruju y'omugabe, baaba niho baamwitira.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JOS 24:25">Yos 24:25</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 5:3">2 Sam 5:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yehoyaada yaaragaanisa omugabe n'abantu endagaano na MUKAMA kuba abantu be; kandi yaagaruka yaaragaanisa omugabe n'abantu endiijo ndagaano. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:3">Bir 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 10:21">2 Bag 10:21</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 10:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 10:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Okuruga aho abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baaza ahari nyaruju ya Baali, baagisheenya; amatambiro ge n'ebishushani bye baabisheenyagurira kimwe, baitira Mataani omunyamurwa wa Baali omu maisho g'ago matambiro. Kandi omunyamurwa yaata abarinzi aha nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Bwanyima yaatwara abakuru b'engabo, Abakariti, abarinzi, n'abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi, baiha omugabe omu nju ya MUKAMA, baamushuumya, baamurabya omu irembo ry'abarinzi, baamutaasya omuri nyaruju y'omugabe, yaashutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Batyo abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baashemererwa; kandi Atalia ku yaaherize kwitirwa aha nju y'omugabe na rurara, haabaho okutuuza omu rurembo. <verse eid="2KI 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:21—12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 24:1-14">2 Bus 24:1-14</ref>. </char></note> Yoasi akatandika kutegyeka ahikize emyaka mushanju.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yoasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Omu mwaka gwa mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehu, Yoasi akatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera omuri Yerusaalemu emyaka makumi ana. Eiziina rya nyina akaba ari Zibia owa Beeri-sheba. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Yoasi yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA ebiro byona ebi yaamazire naahaburwa Yehoyaada omunyamurwa. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:14">1 Bag 15:14</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 22:43">22:43</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:4">2 Bag 14:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:35">15:35</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu teraihirweho, kureka abantu bakagumizamu nibagitambiramu ebitambo, kandi nibootereramu obubaane.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 35:5">Kur 35:5</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:4-6">2 Bag 22:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 29:9">1 Bus 29:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yoasi yaagambira abanyamurwa ati: Empiiha zoona ez'ebintu ebishoroirwe ezireetsirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'empiiha z'abantu boona, nk'oku buri muntu arikucwerwa, kandi n'empiiha ezi omuntu weena arikwesiimira kureeta omu nju ya MUKAMA aihire aha mutima, <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />abanyamurwa bazitware, buri omwe aziihe ahari mugyenzi we, bazihunduuze enju, ahi esiisikaire hoona. <verse eid="2KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Kwonka okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoasi, abanyamurwa bakaba bataine ki baahundwize kyona ahari egyo nju. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Nikyo omugabe Yoasi yaatumiire Yehoyaada omunyamurwa n'abandi banyamurwa, akababuuza ati: Ahabw'enki mutarikuhunduuza enju? Mbwenu murekyere aho kwiha empiiha ahari bagyenzi baanyu, kureka muziheyo ahabw'okuhunduuza enju. <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Batyo abanyamurwa baikiriza kutagaruka kwiha empiiha aha bantu, n'obu kwakuba okuhunduuza enju.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 12:41">Mak 12:41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:1">Luk 21:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Yehoyaada omunyamurwa yaareeta eshanduukye, yaafumura ekifundikizo kyayo, yaagita haihi n'eitambiro aha rubaju rwa buryo omuntu yaaba naataaha omu nju ya MUKAMA; kandi abanyamurwa abaabaire barinda eirembo baaguma nibatamu empiiha zoona ezaabaire nizireetwa omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Ku baabaire bareeba empiiha zaaba nyingi omuri egyo shanduukye, omuhandiiki w'omugabe n'omunyamurwa omukuru baija, bazibara, bazikoma omu nshaho, zoona ezi bashanga omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Bwanyima ezo mpiiha ezi babazire baziha abakozi abarikureeberera enju ya MUKAMA; nabo baziha ababaizi n'abombeki abarikukora egyo nju, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:5">2 Bag 22:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 22:6">6</ref>. </char></note> n'abarikwombekyesa amabaare, n'abarikugashara; ezindi bazihayo kugura embaaho n'amabaare agabaizire eby'okuhunduuza enju ya MUKAMA, n'ahabw'ebindi byona ebirikwetengwa kuhunduuza egyo nju. <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:50">1 Bag 7:50</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:14">2 Bus 24:14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka ezo mpiiha ezi baabaire bareeta omu nju ya MUKAMA tibarazikoreise bikopo by'efeeza, nari makansi z'entambi, nari enyabya, nari amakondere, n'obu byakuba ebindi bintu by'ezaabu nari eby'efeeza, <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />kureka zo bakaba baziha abakozi abarikuzikoresa enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:7">2 Bag 22:7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abo bashaija abu baabaire baha empiiha z'okwihura abakozi, bakaba batababuuza oku zikoresiibwe, ahabw'okuba bakaba bazikoresa n'obwesigwa. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 4:24">Lev 4:24</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 4:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 5:15">5:15</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 5:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 7:7">7:7</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 18:19">Kub 18:19</ref>. </char></note> Empiiha z'empongano z'okwihaho orubanja, n'ez'empongano z'ekibi zikaba zitareetwa mu nju ya MUKAMA; zikaba ziba ez'abanyamurwa.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">12:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 19:17">1 Bag 19:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:23">2 Bus 24:23</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 24:24">24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria akainamuka, yaarwanisa Gaasi, yaagikubuura. Bwanyima Hazaeli amaisho ge yaagata ahari Yerusaalemu, kwinamukayo kugiteera. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 15:18">1 Bag 15:18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:14">2 Bag 14:14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo Yoasi omugabe wa Yuda yaatwara ebintu byona ebirikwera ebyahairwe baishenkuru, Yehoshafaati na Yehoraamu na Ahazia abagabe ba Yuda, hamwe n'ebintu bye ahabwe ebi yaahaireyo, kandi n'ezaabu yoona eyaashangirwe omu mabiikiro g'enju ya MUKAMA n'ag'enju y'omugabe, yaabitwekyera Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria. Atyo Hazaeli yaaruga ahari Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yoasi n'ebi yaakozire byona tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'obusingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 5:9">2 Sam 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:5">2 Bag 14:5</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 24:25-27">2 Bus 24:25-27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abagaragwa be baimuka, baamugiira omu naama, baamwitira omu nju ya Miilo omu muhanda gurikushuuma Siila; <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />abo bagaragwa be abaamuteire akafa, ni Yozakaari mwene Shimeasi na Yehozabadi mwene Shomeri. Yaaziikwa omu rurembo rwa Daudi, yaashanga baishenkuru; Amazia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yehoahazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri n'eshatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoasi mwene Ahazia omugabe wa Yuda, Yehoahazi mwene Yehu akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka ikumi na mushanju. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:16">1 Bag 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, yaakurata Yeroboamu mwene Nebati omu bibi bye ebi yaasiisiise Israeli, tiyaabireka. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 2:14">Bar 2:14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaagirira Israeli ekiniga, yaaguma naabahayo omu mikono ya Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria, n'omu mikono ya Benihadadi omutabani. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:7">Kur 3:7</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 3:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:11">32:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:26">2 Bag 14:26</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 78:34">Zab 78:34</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoahazi yaayeshengyereza MUKAMA, MUKAMA yaamuhurira; ahakuba akareeba okwitwa kubi kw'Abaisraeli, oku omugabe wa Siria yaabaire naabaita kubi. (<verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 3:9">Bar 3:9</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:27">Neh 9:27</ref>. </char></note>N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaaha Abaisraeli omujuni, baaruga omu mikono y'Abasiria; batyo Abaisraeli baatuura omu maka gaabo nk'omu biro bya ira. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 16:33">1 Bag 16:33</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka tibaaruga mu bibi by'enju ya Yeroboamu, ebi yaasiisiise Israeli; baaguma nibabigyenderamu; kandi na Ashera nazo zaaguma omuri Samaria.) <verse eid="2KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:3">Amo 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba Yehoahazi taratsigaize bantu, kureka ab'aha mbaraasi makumi ataano, n'ebigaari, n'engabo ezirikugyendesa ebigyere kakumi ahakuba omugabe wa Siria akabacwekyereza, yaabagira nk'omucuucu gw'aha mbuga. <verse eid="2KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yehoahazi n'ebi yaakozire byona n'eby'amaani ge tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Atyo Yehoahazi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika omuri Samaria; Yehoashi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Yoasi omugabe wa Yuda, Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria, yamara aha ngoma emyaka ikumi na mukaaga. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Nawe yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli, kureka yaaguma naabigyenderamu. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:8-14">2 Bag 14:8-14</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yehoashi, n'ebi yaakozire byona, n'eby'amaani ge, agu yaarwaniise naarwana na Amazia omugabe wa Yuda, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Atyo Yehoashi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, Yeroboamu yaaza aha kitebe kye ky'obugabe, bwanyima Yehoashi yaaziikwa Samaria hamwe n'abagabe ba Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Elisa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 2:12">2 Bag 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli, ku yaabaire akiri aha ngoma, Elisa yaakwatwa endwara eyaamwitsire; omugabe yaashuuma kumwinamira, yaamuririra, naagira ati: Ai bambe Taata! Taata! Ebigaari bya Israeli n'ab'aha mbaraasi baayo! <verse eid="2KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisa yaamugira ati: Kwata obuta n'emyambi. Atyo yaabikwata. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Nanuura obuta! Yaabunanuura; Elisa yaata engaro aha z'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Bwanyima yaagira ati: Igura edirisa erikureeba oburugwa-izooba. Onu yaagiigura. Elisa yaamugira ati: Rasha. Onu yaarasha. Yaagaruka yaagira ati: Ogwo n'omwambi gwa MUKAMA gw'obusinguzi ogw'okusingura Siria! Ahakuba noija kurwanira omuri Afeki n'Abasiria, okuhitsya obu oraabaite okabamaraho. <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Bwanyima yaagira omugabe wa Israeli ati: Kwata emyambi. Onu yaagikwata. Yaagaruka yaamugira ati: Giteere ahansi. Yaagiteera ahansi kashatu, yaarereera. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Ogwo mushaija wa Ruhanga yaamugwerwa kubi, yaamugira ati: Waaba oshemereire kugiteera ahansi emirundi etaano nari mukaaga; haza obwo obona kusingura Abasiria, obamariraho kimwe; kwonka hati noija kubasingura emirundi eshatu yonka.<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 1:1">2 Bag 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 3:7">3:7</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:2">24:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Elisa yaafa, baamuziika. Kandi omu biro ebyo emitwe y'Abamoabu ekaba eteera ensi aha kutandika kw'omwaka. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Eizooba rimwe ku baabaire nibaziika omuntu, baareeba omutwe gw'abanyagi, baamutambika omu kituuro kya Elisa; omutumbi ku gwahikire guti aha magufa ga Elisa, ogwo muntu yaahimbuuka, yaimuka, yaayemerera.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">13:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 8:12">2 Bag 8:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu busingye bwona obwa Yehoahazi, Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria akaita kubi Abaisraeli; <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 2:24">Kur 2:24</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 2:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 32:13">32:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:27">2 Bag 14:27</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka MUKAMA akaba abagirira embabazi n'esaasi, abataho omutima ahabw'endagaano ei yaaragaine na Abrahamu, Isaaka na Yakobo, kandi akaba atacwekyereza, n'obu kwakuba kubabingira kimwe omu maisho ge omu biro ebyo.<verse eid="2KI 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Hazaeli omugabe wa Siria ku yaafiire, Beni-hadadi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:32">2 Bag 10:32</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:25">14:25</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi yaiha ahari Benihadadi mwene Hazaeli endembo ezi Hazaeli yaabaire anyagire ahari ishe omu bweme. Yehoashi yaamusingura kashatu, yaagarura endembo za Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s1">Omugabe wa Israeli okurwana n'owa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:1-6: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 14:1-6">2 Bag 14:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 25:1-4">2 Bus 25:1-4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi omugabe wa Israeli, Amazia mwene Yoasi omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:21">2 Bag 12:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:10">13:10</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Yaatandika kutegyeka aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, yaamara emyaka makumi abiri na mwenda ari aha ngoma omuri Yerusaalemu. Eiziina rya nyina akaba ari Yehoadaani owa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, kwonka tiyaaba nka ishenkuru Daudi; kureka yaakora nk'ebi Yoasi ishe yaakozire byona. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">2 Bag 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu tiyaihwaho; abantu baaguma nibagitambiramu ebitambo, kandi nibagyotereramu obubaane. <verse eid="2KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:20">2 Bag 12:20</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima ku yaaherize kuhama omu bugabe bwe, yaita abashaija be abaitsire ishe ari aha ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:16">Bir 24:16</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:30">Yer 31:30</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 18:4">Ezk 18:4</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 18:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abaana b'abo baitsi abaitsire ishe tiyaabaita, nk'oku kyahandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'ebiragiro bya Musa, eki MUKAMA yaaragiriiremu ati: Baishe b'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa abaana baabo; kandi n'abaana batariitwa nibaturwa baishebo; kureka omuntu weena aryaitwa ahabw'ekibi kye.<verse eid="2KI 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 25:11">2 Bus 25:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima yaitira Abanyaedomu kakumi omu ruhanga rw'Omwonyo, kandi yaateera Seela, yaagikubuura, yaagyeta Yokise-eli nk'oku erikwetwa n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2KI 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:8-14; </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 25:17-24">2 Bus 25:17-24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Amazia yaatuma entumwa ahari Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi, mwijukuru wa Yehu omugabe wa Israeli, naagira ati: Rugayo, twereebanire akaso omu kandi. <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 9:8-15">Bar 9:8-15</ref>. </char></note> Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yaatuma ahari Amazia omugabe wa Yuda naagira ati: Eitojo rya Lebanooni rikatuma aha mwereezi gwa Lebanooni nirigira riti: Ha mutabani wangye muhara waawe, amushwere. Ku bwaseesire, enyamaishwa y'omu ihamba rya Lebanooni yaija neerabaho, yaariribata. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:14">Bir 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 26:16">2 Bus 26:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 32:25">32:25</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezk 28:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 28:5">5</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 28:17">17</ref>. </char></note> N'ekya buzima oteire Abanyaedomu waabasingura, omutima gwawe gwakureetera eigundu. Yehimbise ahabw'ekitiinisa kyawe, kwonka ogume omuka; ahabw'enki nootaara akabi, ngu ofe na Yuda?<verse eid="2KI 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Kwonka Amazia tiyaabyetaho. N'ahabw'ekyo Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yainamuka kubugana Amazia omugabe wa Yuda; baabugaabuganira Beti-shemeshi eya Yuda, baarwanirayo. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Abaisraeli baabinga Abayuda, buri muntu yaahungira omu ka ye. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 25:23">2 Bus 25:23</ref>. </char></note> Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli yaakwata Amazia omugabe wa Yuda, mwene Yoasi, mwijukuru wa Ahazia, yaamukwatira Betishemeshi; bwanyima yaaza Yerusaalemu, yaasheenya orugo rwayo rw'amabaare ekicweka kya mikono magana ana, okuruga aha irembo rya Efuraimu okuhika aha irembo ry'Akeekubo. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Kandi yaanyaga ezaabu n'efeeza zoona, n'ebintu byona ebyashangirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu mabiikiro g'enju y'omugabe, kandi yaabaihamu abantu, yaabagira omukwato; bwanyima yaagaruka Samaria.<verse eid="2KI 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 13:12">2 Bag 13:12</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:13">13</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yehoashi, n'ebi yaakozire n'eby'amaani ge, n'oku yaarwaine na Amazia omugabe wa Yuda, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Yehoashi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omuri Samaria hamwe n'abagabe ba Israeli. Bwanyima Yeroboamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:17-22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 25:25-26:2">2 Bus 25:25—26:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Amazia mwene Yoasi omugabe wa Yuda yaamara emyaka ikumi n'etaano bwanyima y'okufa kwa Yehoashi mwene Yehoahazi omugabe wa Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Amazia tehandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Abantu baamugiira omu naama bari Yerusaalemu, yaahungira Lakishi; kwonka baamukuratsayo abantu, baamwitirayo. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Baamureeta aha mbaraasi, baamuziika Yerusaalemu omu rurembo rwa Daudi hamwe na baishenkuru. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Bwanyima abantu boona ab'omuri egyo nsi baatwara Uziya owaabaire aine emyaka ikumi na mukaaga, baamwemeka omu mwanya gwa Amazia ishe. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Omugabe ku yaaherize kugwejegyera n'okushanga baishenkuru, Uziya yaayombeka Elaasi, yaarugarurira obugabe bwa Yuda.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu owa kabiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'etaano ogw'omu busingye bwa Amazia mwene Yoasi, omugabe wa Yuda, Yeroboamu mwene Yehoashi omugabe wa Israeli, akatandika kutegyekyera omuri Samaria, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka makumi ana na gumwe. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:16">1 Bag 14:16</ref>. </char></note>Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati ebi yaasiisiise Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JON 1:1">Yon 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Yaagarura emyatano ya Israeli okuruga ahu orikutaahira nooza Hamasi okuhika aha Nyanja ya Araba, nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli oku kyabaire kiri, eki yaagambire naaraba omu mwiru we nabi Yona mwene Amitai, owaarugire Gaasi-heferi. <verse eid="2KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 32:36">Bir 32:36</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 13:4">2 Bag 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba MUKAMA akareeba okubonabona kwa Israeli kuri kwingi munonga; ahabw'okuba tihaine n'omwe owaatsigaireho, yaaba muhuuku, nari ow'obusingye, n'obu yaakuba ow'okuha Israeli emikono. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:5">2 Bag 13:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 13:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba MUKAMA akaba agizire ngu tarikwija kumariraho kimwe iziina rya Israeli ahansi y'eiguru; n'ahabw'ekyo yaabajunisa Yeroboamu mutabani wa Yehoashi.<verse eid="2KI 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">14:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2SA 8:6">2 Sam 8:6</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:24">1 Bag 11:24</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 8:3">2 Bus 8:3</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yeroboamu n'ebi yaakozire byona n'eby'amaani ge, oku yaarwaine, n'oku yaagaruriire Israeli Damasiko na Hamasi, ezaabaire ziri eza Yuda, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Yeroboamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru abagabe ba Israeli; Zekaria omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Uziya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 11:13">2 Bag 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:21">14:21</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu omugabe wa Israeli <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Uziya nari Azaria. </char></note>Uziya mutabani wa Amaziya omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:1">2 Bus 26:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 26:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 26:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Yaatandika kutegyeka aine emyaka ikumi na mukaaga; yaategyekyera emyaka makumi ataano n'ebiri omuri Yerusaalemu. Eiziina rya nyina akaba ari Yekolia owa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Amazia ishe yaakozire byona oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">2 Bag 12:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu teraihirweho; abantu bakaba bagitambiramu, kandi bagyotereraho obubaane. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:21-23">2 Bus 26:21-23</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima MUKAMA yaateera omugabe, yaarwara ebibembe, yaaguma omu nganyo okuhitsya aha izooba eri yaafeereireho. Kandi Yosamu omutabani niwe yaabaire ari omukuru w'ekikaari, naategyeka abantu b'omuri egyo nsi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:46">Lev 13:46</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Uziya n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Uziya yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Yosamu omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okuhungurirana kw'abagabe babi omuri Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na munaana ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Zekaria mutabani wa Yeroboamu akategyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria ameezi mukaaga. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:16">1 Bag 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'oku baishenkuru baakozire. Tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, ebi yaasiisiise Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 7:9">Amo 7:9</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba rimwe Shalumu mwene Yabeshi yaamugirira enaama, yaamwitira omu maisho g'abantu, yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Endiijo mirimo ya Zekaria n'ebi yaakozire bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 10:30">2 Bag 10:30</ref>. </char></note> Okwo nikwo kuragaanisa kwa MUKAMA oku yaaraganiise Yehu naagira ati: Batabani baawe baryashutama aha kitebe ky'obugabe okuhitsya aha bwijukuru bwa kana. Kandi nikwo kyabaire.<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 16:24">1 Bag 16:24</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:1">2 Bag 15:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Shalumu mwene Yabeshi akatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera okwezi kumwe omuri Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Bwanyima Menahemu mwene Gaadi yaaruga Tiruza, yaija Samaria, yaitirayo Shalumu mwene Yabeshi, yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Endiijo mirimo ya Shalumu yoona, n'okugoma oku yaagomire, reeba bihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Bwanyima omu biro ebyo Menahemu akateera Tifusa, yaagicwekyereza n'abaabaire barimu boona, n'ebyaro byayo byona okuruga Tiruza okuhika aha myatano yaayo; eki yaagicwekyerereize n'ahabw'okuba bakanga kumwigurira amarembo, kandi n'abakazi baamwo abaabaire baine enda yaabashatura aha nda.<verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ashatu na mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda, Menahemu mwene Gaadi akatandika kutegyeka Israeli, yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi omuri Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA; omu biro bye byona tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati ebi yaasiisiise Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 5:26">1 Bus 5:26</ref>. </char></note> Eizooba rimwe Puuli omugabe wa Asiria yaateera egyo nsi; Menahemu yaamuhongyera etalanta z'efeeza rukumi, ngu amuhwere abone kuhama omu bugabe bwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Kandi ezo mpiiha Menahemu akaba aziihire omu batungi boona ab'omuri Israeli, buri muntu omuribo shekeli z'efeeza makumi ataano, ngu abone kuziha ogwo mugabe wa Asiria. N'ahabw'ekyo omugabe wa Asiria yaakuba yaagarukayo, tiyaaguma muri egyo nsi. <verse eid="2KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Menahemu n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli? <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Menahemu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru; omutabani Pekahia yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ataano ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda Pekahia mwene Menahemu akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria; yaamara emyaka ebiri ari aha ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:16">1 Bag 14:16</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu mwene Nebati, ebi yaasiisiise Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Bwanyima Peeka mwene Remalia, omukuru w'engabo ze, yaamugiira omu naama, yaamwitira Samaria omu kigo ky'omu kikaari ky'omugabe. Ku yaaherize kumwita, yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Pekahia n'ebi yaakozire byona, bikahandiikwa omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Omu mwaka gwa makumi ataano ogw'omu busingye bwa Uziya omugabe wa Yuda Peeka mwene Remalia akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria, yaamara emyaka makumi abiri ari aha ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, tiyaareka bibi bya Yeroboamu, ebi yaasiisiise Israeli.<verse eid="2KI 15:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">15:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 15:20">1 Bag 15:20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:7">2 Bag 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 5:6">1 Bus 5:6</ref>, <ref loc="1CH 5:26">26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro bya Peeka omugabe wa Israeli Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria yaija, yaakwata Iyooni, Abeelibesi-maaka, Yanoa, Kedeshi, Hazori, Gileadi na Galilaaya, ensi yoona eya Nafutaali; kandi abantu yaabatwara Asiria bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:1">2 Bag 17:1</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hoshea mwene Ela yaagiira Peeka mwene Remalia omu naama, yaamuteera, yaamwita; yaatandika kutegyeka omu mwanya gwe omu mwaka gwa makumi abiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Yosamu mwene Uziya. <verse eid="2KI 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Peeka n'ebi yaakozire byona bikahandiikwa omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Omu mwaka gwa kabiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Peeka mwene Remalia omugabe wa Israeli Yosamu mwene Uziya omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 27:1">2 Bus 27:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 27:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Obu yaatandikire kutegyeka, akaba ahikize emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, yaamara emyaka ikumi na mukaaga ari aha ngoma omuri Yerusaalemu. Kandi nyina akaba naayetwa Yerusha mwene Zadoki. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:3">2 Bag 15:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 27:6">2 Bus 27:6</ref>. </char></note> Akakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi Uziya ishe yaakozire byona. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:3">2 Bag 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 27:3">2 Bus 27:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu tiyaasheenywa; kureka abantu bakaguma bagitambiramu ebitambo, bagyotereramu obubaane. Kandi yaayombeka eirembo ry'ekikaari kya MUKAMA ery'aharuguru.<verse eid="2KI 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yosamu n'ebi yaakozire byona tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:5">2 Bag 16:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7:1</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo MUKAMA akatandika kutuma Rezini omugabe wa Siria na Peeka mwene Remalia kurwanisa Yuda. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Bwanyima Yosamu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi ishenkuru; Ahazi omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Ahazi omugabe wa Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na mushanju ogw'omu busingye bwa Peeka mwene Remalia, Ahazi mwene Yosamu omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:2-4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:1-4">2 Bus 28:1-4</ref>. </char></note> Akaba ahikize emyaka makumi abiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi na mukaaga omuri Yerusaalemu. Tiyaakora birikusiimwa MUKAMA Ruhanga we, nk'oku ishenkuru Daudi yaakozire, <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:2">2 Bag 21:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 12:31">Bir 12:31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:9">18:9</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 106:37">Zab 106:37</ref>, <ref loc="PSA 106:38">38</ref>. </char></note> kureka yaagyendera omu mitwarize y'abagabe ba Israeli; kandi yaarabya n'omutabani omu muriro, naakuratira ebirikunugwa eby'abanyamahanga, abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:2">Bir 12:2</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:23">1 Bag 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 14:4">2 Bag 14:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaaguma naatambira ebitambo, naayoterera obubaane omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu n'aha bibungo kandi n'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi.<verse eid="2KI 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:5: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:37">2 Bag 15:37</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima Rezini omugabe wa Siria na Peeka mwene Remalia omugabe wa Israeli bainamuka kuteera Yerusaalemu; baagota Ahazi, kwonka tibaabaasa kumusingura. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 14:22">2 Bag 14:22</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo nimwo omugabe wa Edomu yaagaruriire Elaasi omuri Edomu, akabingamu abashaija ba Yuda; Abanyaedomu bakaija omuri Elaasi; bakagumamu n'okuhitsya hati. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Bag 15:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:16">2 Bus 28:16</ref>. </char></note> Atyo Ahazi yaatuma entumwa ahari Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria, naagira ati: Ndi omwiru waawe kandi omwana waawe. Rugayo onjune omugabe wa Siria n'owa Israeli, abanteire. <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:18">2 Bag 12:18</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaatwara efeeza n'ezaabu ezaashangirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA n'omu mabikiro g'enju y'omugabe, yaabitoijera omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="AMO 1:5">Amo 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Asiria yaamwikiriza, yaahurura, yaateera Damasiko, yaagikwata, n'abantu baamwo yaabatwara Kiiri bari enkwatwa, kandi yaita na Reziini. <verse eid="2KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 8:2">Isa 8:2</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Ahazi ku yaagiire Damasiko kubugana Tigulaasi-pileseeri omugabe wa Asiria, yaareebayo eitambiro. Yaatwekyera Uriya omunyamurwa eky'okureeberaho ky'eryo itambiro, ekyabaire nikishushanira kimwe naryo omu miringo yoona. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Uriya omunyamurwa yaayombeka eryo itambiro, naarishushanisiza kimwe n'ebi omugabe Ahazi yaatwekire ari Damasiko byona; atyo ogwo munyamurwa yaarikora, omugabe Ahazi atakagarukire naaruga Damasiko. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 26:16-19">2 Bus 26:16-19</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe ku yaarugire Damasiko, yaareeba eitambiro; bwanyima yaariirira haihi, yaaritembaho. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Yaaryokyezaho ekitambo kye ky'okwotsya n'empongano ye y'esaano, yaarishukaho empongano ye y'eky'okunywa, kandi yaarishukyera eshagama y'empongano ze ez'okusiima ahabw'obusingye. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 40:6">Kur 40:6</ref>, <ref loc="EXO 40:29">29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 4:1">2 Bus 4:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi eitambiro ry'emiringa eryabaire rituura omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaariiha omu maisho g'enju omu mwanya gwaryo ahagati y'eitambiro rye n'enju ya MUKAMA, yaarita aha rubaju rw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho obw'eitambiro rye. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 29:39-41">Kur 29:39-41</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe Ahazi yaaragiira Uriya omunyamurwa naagira ati: Aha itambiro erihango obe niho waaguma nooyokyeza ekitambo ekyokibwa omu kasheeshe, n'empongano y'esaano ey'omumwabazyo, n'ekitambo ky'omugabe eky'okwotsya n'empongano ye ey'esaano, hamwe n'ekitambo ky'okwotsya eky'abantu boona ab'eryo ihanga n'empongano yaabyo ey'esaano n'ey'ebyokunywa; kandi orishukyere eshagama yoona ey'ekitambo ky'okwotsya n'ey'ebindi bitambo; kwonka eitambiro ry'emiringa rigume ribe eryangye ery'okwehanuurizaho. <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Uriya omunyamurwa yaakora ebyo byona, nk'oku omugabe Ahazi yaamuragiire.<verse eid="2KI 16:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">16:17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 7:23">1 Bag 7:23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:25">25</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:27">27</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:28">28</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:38">38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe Ahazi yaashara aha binaabiro ebiremu by'ebitebe byabyo, yaiha ahari buri kimwe ekinaabiro kyakyo; kandi yaiha ekitanka aha nimi z'emiringa ezaabaire ziri ahansi yaakyo, yaakita aha mabaare agaariire. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Kandi omuhanda ogushakaire ogw'okurabamu ahari Sabato, ogwabaire gwombekire okuruga omu kikaari okuhika aha irembo ry'omugabe ery'aheeru eririkutaaha omuri hekalu, yaagwiha aha nju ya MUKAMA ahabw'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:6">2 Bus 28:6</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Ahazi n'ebi yaakozire byona tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 28:7">2 Bus 28:7</ref>. </char></note> Ahazi yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, baamuziika hamwe nabo omu rurembo rwa Daudi; Hezekia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s1">Abaasiria okukwata Abaisraeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 15:30">2 Bag 15:30</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ebiri ogw'omu busingye bwa Ahazi omugabe wa Yuda Hoshea mutabani wa Ela akatandika kutegyekyera Israeli omuri Samaria, yaamara emaka mwenda aha ngoma. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, kwonka tiyaashushana na bagabe ba Israeli abaamubandiize. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:9-12">2 Bag 18:9-12</ref>. </char></note> Shalumaneseeri omugabe wa Asiria yainamuka, yaamuteera; Hoshea yaahinduka omwiru we, yaaguma naamutoijera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:14">Hos 10:14</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Asiria yaashanga Hoshea amugiriire enaama; ahakuba akaba atumire entumwa ahari So omugabe wa Misri, kandi ayangire kutwekyera omugabe wa Asiria emitoijo, nk'oku yaabaire amutoijera buri mwaka. Nikyo omugabe wa Asiria yaamuteereire omu kihome akamuboha. <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Asira yainamuka, yaaraba omuri egyo nsi yoona, yaahika Samaria, yaagigota okumara emyaka eshatu. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 28:36">Bir 28:36</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 28:64">64</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:27">29:27</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 29:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:11">2 Bag 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 5:26">1 Bus 5:26</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 13:17">Isa 13:17</ref>. </char></note> Omu mwaka gwa mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Hoshea, omugabe wa Asiria yaakwata Samaria, yaatwara Abaisraeli Asiria bari enkwatwa, yaabata omuri Haala n'aha mugyera Habora ogw'omuri Gozani, n'omu ndembo z'Abameedi.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:36">2 Bag 17:36</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:2">Kur 20:2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 25:38">Lev 25:38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kikabaho ahabw'okuba Abaisraeli bakacumura ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, owabaihire omu nsi ya Misri omu mikono ya Faraho omugabe waayo, baatiina baaruhanga abandi, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">2 Bag 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:19">17:19</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:9">Bir 18:9</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 18:3">Lev 18:3</ref>. </char></note> baagyendera omu micwe y'ago mahanga agu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho gaabo, kandi n'omu micwe ei abagabe ba Israeli baabaire bareetsire. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Kandi Abaisraeli baaguma nibakorera omu mubonano ebitahikire nibacumura ahari MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. Baayeyombekyera emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu omuri tauni zaabo zoona, okuruga aha minaara y'abarinzi, okuhika aha ndembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare; <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:23">1 Bag 14:23</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:13">34:13</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 5:14">Mik 5:14</ref>. </char></note> kandi baayebyarira enyomyo z'amabaare na Ashera ahari buri kibungo kyona ekiraingwa, n'ahansi ya buri kiti ekyetwa omurinzi, <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />okwo niyo baayoterereire obubaane omu myanya yoona emikuru y'okuramizamu, nk'oku ago mahanga gaakozire agu MUKAMA yaatwaire akaiha omu maisho gaabo. Baakora ebindi bibi, baagwisa kubi MUKAMA, <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:4">Kur 20:4</ref>. </char></note> baaheereza ebishushani ebirikuramibwa ebi MUKAMA yaabaire abagizire ati; Eki mutarikikora. <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 9:9">1 Sam 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:30">Neh 9:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 18:11">Yer 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:5">25:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:15">35:15</ref>. </char></note> N'obu biraabe byabaire biba bityo, hoona MUKAMA akaba ateisa Israeli na Yuda, naagambira omuri buri nabi na buri muhanuuzi, naagira ati: Muhindukye murekye emicwe yaanyu emibi, mworobere ebiragiro byangye n'ebi naataireho, nk'ebiragiro byona ebi naaragiire baashwenkuriimwe, kandi n'ebi naabatumireho nimbirabya omu bairu bangye bombi, oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:6">Bir 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:27">31:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:8">2 Bus 30:8</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 7:51">Byak 7:51</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka banga kuhurira, bagangaara, nka baishenkurubo abaabaire bataikiriza MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:30">Bir 12:30</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 12:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:25">29:25</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 32:21">32:21</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:13">1 Bag 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 2:5">Yer 2:5</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 1:21">Rom 1:21</ref>. </char></note> Bagaya ebi yaataireho, n'endagaano ei yaaragaine na baishenkurubo n'okuteisa oku yaabaire abateisa. Bakuratira ebitaine mugasho, nabo bahinduka ebitaine mugasho, batooreza emicwe y'amahanga agabeehinguririze, agu MUKAMA yaabeehanangiriize kutakora nkago. <verse eid="2KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:19">Bir 4:19</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:15">14:15</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 14:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:13">15:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:31">16:31</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:18">2 Bag 11:18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:3">21:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:5">23:5</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baareka ebiragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, baayekorera ebishushani bibiri by'enyana ebiheesire, kandi baaguma nibakora na Ashera, baramya eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, nibaheereza Baali. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">2 Bag 16:3</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 23:37">Ezk 23:37</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:10">1 Bag 21:10</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:10">Bir 18:10</ref>. </char></note> Barabya batabani baabo na bahara baabo omu muriro nk'ebitambo, baragura, baroga, beehayo kukora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nibamugwisa kubi. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13">1 Bag 11:13</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:20">12:20</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaagwerwa kubi munonga Abaisraeli yaababinga omu maisho ge, tiyaagira u yaatsigaho kureka oruganda rwa Yuda rwonka.<verse eid="2KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:19: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 3:8">Yer 3:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Abayuda nabo tibaayorobera biragiro bya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, kureka baagyendera omu micwe ei Abaisraeli baareetsire. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 13:3">2 Bag 13:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 15:29">15:29</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 2:14">Bar 2:14</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaacwa baijukuru b'Abaisraeli boona, yaababurabuza, yaabahayo omu mikono y'abanyagi, okuhitsya obu yaababingiire kimwe omu maisho ge. <verse eid="2KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:11">1 Bag 11:11</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 12:20">12:20</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:16">14:16</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba akacwa Israeli aha nju ya Daudi, baahindura Yeroboamu mwene Nebati omugabe. Kandi Yeroboamu yaazibira Abaisraeli kukuratira MUKAMA, yaabakoresa ekibi kihango. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Batyo Abaisraeli baagyendera omu bibi byona ebi Yeroboamu yaakozire, tibaabireka, <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:6">2 Bag 17:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:13">13</ref>. </char></note> okuhitsya obu MUKAMA yaabingire Israeli omu maisho ge, nk'oku yaashangirwe agambire naaraba omu bairu be boona baanabi. Okwo nikwo Abaisraeli baabingirwe omu nsi yaabo, bakatwarwa Asiria, bakagumayo n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe wa Asiria okufururira abantu be omu ndembo za Israeli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EZR 4:2">Ezr 4:2</ref>, <ref loc="EZR 4:10">10</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe wa Asiria yaiha abantu Babulooni, Kuusa, Ava, Hamasi, na Sefavaimu, yaabata omu ndembo za Samaria omu mwanya gw'Abaisraeli; baagikubuura, baatuura omu ndembo zaayo. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Ku baabaire bakitandikire kutuurayo, tibaatiina MUKAMA; n'ahabw'ekyo yaabooherereza entare, zaabaitamu abantu. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Batyo baagambira omugabe wa Asiria bati: Amahanga agu otwaire kuta omu ndembo za Samaria tigarikumanya biragiro bya ruhanga w'egyo nsi; n'ahabw'ekyo abooherereize entare; mbwenu reeba, nizibaita, ahabw'okuba tibarikumanya biragiro bya ruhanga w'ensi egyo. <verse eid="2KI 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Omugabe wa Asiria nikwo kuragiira ati: Mugarureyo omunyamurwa omwe aha bu mwaihireyo, agyende atuureyo, abeegyese ebiragiro bya ruhanga w'egyo nsi. <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:28: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 12:29">1 Bag 12:29</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo omwe aha banyamurwa abu baihire Samaria yaija, yaatuura Beseeli, yaaguma naabeegyesa oku bashemereire kutiina MUKAMA.<verse eid="2KI 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">17:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:31">1 Bag 12:31</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 13:32">13:32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kwonka buri ihanga ryaguma niryekorera baaruhanga baaryo, niribata omuri zaanyaruju z'omu myanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, ezi Abasamaria baabaire bombekire, buri ihanga omu ndembo ezi ryabaire ritwiremu. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Aba Babulooni baakora Sukoosi-benosi; aba Kuusi baakora Neregaali; aba Hamasi baakora Ashima; <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />aba Ava baakora Nibuhazi na Tarutaaki; n'aba Sefavaimu baaguma nibootsya abaana omu muriro, nibabatambira Adrameleki na Anameleki, baaruhanga ba Sefavaimu. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEP 1:5">Zef 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bakaba batiina MUKAMA, batoorana omuribo abantu b'emiringo yoona kuba abanyamurwa b'emyanya mikuru; abo nibo baabaire babatambirira ebitambo omuri zaanyaruju z'omuri egyo myanya. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Batyo batiina MUKAMA, kwonka baaguma nibaheereza baaruhanga baabo, nibakuratira emitwarize y'amahanga agu baarugiremu. <verse eid="2KI 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 18:31">1 Bag 18:31</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 32:28">Kut 32:28</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 35:10">35:10</ref>. </char></note> Na hati nibakitwaza nk'oku baabaire batwaza ira.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 17:34">Tibarikutiina MUKAMA, tibarikukuratira byatairweho nari emigyenzo, nari ebiragiro ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire beene Yakobo ou yaayetsire Israeli. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:5">Kur 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:10">Bar 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Abo nibo MUKAMA yaaragaine nabo endagaano akabeehanangiriza naagira ati: Mutaritiina baaruhanga abandi, mutaribainamira, mutaribaheereza n'obu kwakuba okubatambira ebitambo; <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:36: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 6:6">Kur 6:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:34">Bir 4:34</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 6:13">6:13</ref>. </char></note> kureka MUKAMA owaabaihire omu nsi ya Misri n'amaani maingi n'omukono ogubangire, mube niwe mwatiina, mukainamira; kandi mube niwe mwatambira ebitambo. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Bir 5:32</ref>; <ref loc="JDG 6:10">Bar 6:10</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ebyatairweho n'emigyenzo n'ebiragiro, ebi yaaragiire akabibahandiikira, mugume mubiteho omutima, mubyorobere; mutarigira baaruhanga abandi abu mwatiina. <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">17:38: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:23">Bir 4:23</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo endagaano ei naaragaine naimwe mutarigyebwa; mutaritiina baaruhanga abandi, <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />kureka mugume mutiine MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu; niwe aribajuna omu mikono y'abazigu baanyu boona. <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Kwonka bo baayanga kuhurira, baagumizamu n'emicwe yaabo eya ira.<verse eid="2KI 17:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Batyo abantu b'ago mahanga baaguma nibatiina MUKAMA, kandi nibaheereza ebishushani byabo ebibaizire; abaana baabo na baijukuru baabo nabo baagumizamu baakora nk'oku baishekurubo baabaire bakora, n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:1">2 Bag 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 28:27">2 Bus 28:27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 1:9">Mat 1:9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kashatu ogw'omu busingye bwa Hoshea mwene Ela, omugabe wa Israeli, Hezekia mutabani wa Ahazi omugabe wa Yuda akatandika kutegyeka. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 29:1">2 Bus 29:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 29:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Yaatandika aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, yaategyekyera emyaka makumi abiri na mwenda omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Abi muhara wa Zekaria. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 20:3">2 Bag 20:3</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:20">2 Bus 31:20</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA nk'ebi Daudi ishenkuru yaakozire byona oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 21:8">Kub 21:8</ref>, <ref loc="NUM 21:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:10">2 Bag 17:10</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 17:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:22">18:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:1">2 Bus 31:1</ref>. </char></note> Yaihaho emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu, yaasheenya enyomyo z'amabaare, yaatema Ashera; kandi yaacwagacwagura enjoka y'omuringa ei Musa yaabaire akozire, ahabw'okuba okuhitsya omu bunaku obwo Abaisraeli bakaba nibakigyoterera obubaane; neeyetwa Nehushitaane. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:25">2 Bag 23:25</ref>. </char></note> Akaba naayesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli; n'ahabw'ekyo tihariho mugabe weena owaabaire naamushusha omu bagabe ba Yuda boona abaamukuratiire, n'obu baakuba abaamubandiize. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 10:20">Bir 10:20</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 23:8">Yos 23:8</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba akagumira ahari MUKAMA, tiyaareka kumukuratira, yaaguma naayorobera ebiragiro ebi MUKAMA yaaragiire Musa. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:7">2 Bag 16:7</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 15:2">2 Bus 15:2</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaaguma nawe; ei yaabaire ahurura yoona, aba gye. Kandi yaagomera omugabe wa Asiria, yaayanga kumuheereza. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:29">Isa 14:29</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaateera Abafilistia okuruga aha munaara gw'abarinzi okuhika aha ndembo ezizitiire n'engo z'amabaare, yaabahitsya Gaaza n'omu byanga byayo.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:9-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 17:3-7">2 Bag 17:3-7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa kana ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Hezekia, ogwabaire guri omwaka gwa mushanju ogwa Hoshea mwene Ela omugabe wa Israeli, Shalumaneseeri omugabe wa Asiria akainamuka, yaateera Samaria, yaagigota; <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />aha muheru gw'omwaka gwa kashatu yaagikwata. Omu mwaka gwa mukaaga ogwa Hezekia, ogwabaire guri omwaka gwa mwenda ogwa Hoshea omugabe wa Israeli, nimwo Samaria yaakwatiirwe. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Bwanyima omugabe wa Asiria yaatwara Abaisraeli omu nsi ye bari enkwatwa, yaabata omuri Haala, n'aha mugyera Habora ogw'omuri Gozani, n'omu ndembo z'Abameedi, <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />ahakuba tibarahuriire iraka rya MUKAMA Ruhanga waabo, kureka bakaita endagaano ye, nangwa n'ebi Musa omugaragwa wa MUKAMA yaaragiire byona, baayanga kubihurira, n'obu kwakuba okubyorobera.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Omugabe wa Asiria okuteera Yuda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">18:13-37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:1-20">2 Bus 32:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 36:1-22">Isa 36:1-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa ikumi n'ena ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Hezekia, Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria akainamuka, yaateera endembo zoona eza Yuda ezaabaire zizitiirwe n'engo z'amabaare, yaazikwata. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:33">2 Bag 23:33</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda yaatuma aha mugabe wa Asiria ari Lakishi, ati: Nshobize; ndeka; kyona eki orancwe ninkyemera. Omugabe wa Asiria yaacwa Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda etalanta magana ashatu z'efeeza, kandi n'ez'ezaabu makumi ashatu. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:18">2 Bag 12:18</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 16:8">16:8</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia yaamuha efeeza yoona eyaashangirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'omu mabiikiro g'enju y'omugabe. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Omu biro ebyo Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda akaiha ezaabu aha nyigi za hekalu ya MUKAMA, n'aha biti by'emiryango, ei yaabaire abishwekire, yaagiha omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 20:1">Isa 20:1</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Asiria, ku yaabaire akiri Lakishi, yaatuma abatware be Tarutaani, Rabusaari, na Rabushaake, n'eihe rihango aha mugabe Hezekia omuri Yerusaalemu. Bainamuka, baaza Yerusaalemu. Ku baahikireyo, baayemerera aha mukura gw'ekiyanja ky'eruguru, ekiri aha muhanda rugyendwa ogurikuza aha kibanja ky'omwozi. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 22:15">Isa 22:15</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 22:20">20</ref>. </char></note> Ku baayetsire omugabe, haija Eliakimu mwene Hilukia, owaabaire ari omukuru w'ekikaari, na Shebuna omuhandiiki, na Yoa mwene Asafu omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho, baabashanga aho.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Omutware Rabushaake yaabagira ati: Mwirooko mugire Hezekia muti: Oku nikwo omugabe rugambwa, omugabe wa Asiria arikugamba naagira ati: Mbwenu ou orikwesiga n'oha? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Noogira ngu ebigambo bugambo nibyo naama n'amaani eby'okurwanisa? Hari ou oyegamiire hati n'oha, waaza kungomera? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 30:2">Isa 30:2</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:3">3</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 30:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:6">Ezk 29:6</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 29:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, hati oyegamiire Misri, orubango oruri nk'ekibungo kihendekire, ekirikwija kucumita ekiganja ky'omuntu weena orikukihimbagiriraho. Okwo nikwo na Faraho omugabe wa Misri ari ahari boona abarikumwesiga. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:4">2 Bag 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:1">2 Bus 31:1</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ku murangire muti: Nitwesiga MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, tiwe ogwo ou Hezekia yaihireho emyanya ye mikuru ey'okuramizamu n'amatambiro ge, naagira Abayuda n'aba Yerusaalemu ati: Mushemereire kuramiza omu maisho g'eri itambiro eriri Yerusaalemu? <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Mbwenu ija okwatirizane na mukama wangye omugabe wa Asiria. Nkuhe embaraasi enkumi ibiri; ku oraabone ab'okuzitemba, ongire kwo! <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Noija kubaasa ota kubinga omwe aha bakuru bangye b'engabo ab'amaani makye okukira abandi, ku oraabe oyesigire Misri kuba nibo baakuha ebigaari n'ab'aha mbaraasi? <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Kandi noogira ngu nyizire kuteera omwanya ogu n'okugucwekyereza ntaragiirwe MUKAMA? Omanye ngu MUKAMA niwe angambiire ati: Inamuka, oteere egyo nsi, ogicwekyereze.<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Bwanyima Eliakimu mwene Hilukia na Shebuna na Yoa baagira omutware Rabushaake bati: Twakweshengyereza, gamba n'abairu baawe omu rurimi rw'Abasiria; ahakuba itwe niturumanya; reka kugamba omu rurimi rw'Abayuda, abantu abari ha rugo rw'amabaare babihuriire. <verse eid="2KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Kwonka omutware Rabushaake yaabagarukamu ati: Nimugira ngu mukama wangye antumire ahari mukama waanyu naimwe kuba niimwe naagambira ebigambo ebi mwenka? Tantumire kubigambira n'abashaija bariya abashutami aha rugo, abarikwija kurya naimwe amazi gaabo, n'okunywa naimwe enkari yaago?<verse eid="2KI 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Ahonaaho omutware Rabushaake yaayemerera, yaagamba n'eiraka rihango omu rurimi rw'Abayuda, naagira ati: Muhurire obutumwa bw'omugabe rugambwa, omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Oku nikwo omugabe arikugamba naagira ati: Mutaikiriza Hezekia kubabeiha; ahabw'okuba tarikwija kubaasa kubajuna abaihe omu mikono yangye. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Mutaikiriza Hezekia kubeesigisa MUKAMA naabagira ati: Buzimazima MUKAMA naija kutujuna, kandi orurembo oru tirurikwija kuheebwayo mu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Mutahurira Hezekia; ahakuba oku nikwo omugabe wa Asiria arikugamba naagira ati: Mugarukane naanye; mwije munshangye aha; obwo buri omwe omuriimwe nibwo araarye ahamuzaabibu gwe, akarya ahamutiini gwe, kandi akanywa amaizi g'omu iziba rye, <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />okuhitsya obu ndiija, nkabatwara omu nsi erikushushana n'eyaanyu, ensi y'engano na viinyo, ey'emigaati n'emizaabibu, kandi ey'emizeituuni n'obwoki, mukabona kugumaho, mutafe. N'ahabw'ekyo mutahurira Hezekia orikubabeihabeiha naabagira ati: MUKAMA naija kutujuna. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:12">2 Bag 19:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:10">Isa 10:10</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 10:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Nimugira ngu hariho ruhanga omuri baaruhanga b'abanyamahanga orajunire ensi ye omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:13">2 Bag 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:9">Isa 10:9</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu baaruhanga ba Hamasi na Arupaadi barahi? Na baaruhanga ba Sefavaimu, ba Hena n'aba Iiva barahi? Barajunire Samaria omu mikono yangye? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:35: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 3:15">Dan 3:15</ref>. </char></note> Ni baahi omuri baaruhanga boona ab'ezo nsi abarajunire ensi yaabo omu mikono yangye, mukabona kwesiga ku MUKAMA arikwija kwiha Yerusaalemu omu mikono yangye?<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Abantu baahunama, tibaagira ki baamugarukamu, ahabw'okuba ekiragiro ky'omugabe kikaba nikigira kiti: Mutamugarukamu. <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Bwanyima Eliakimu mwene Hilukia omukuru w'ekikaari, na Shebuna omuhandiiki, na Yoa mwene Asafu omuhandiiki w'ebirikubaho baija ahari Hezekia bataagwire ebijwaro byabo, baamuteekyerereza ebigambo bya Rabushaake.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s1">Okushaba kwa Hezekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:1-37: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:20-22">2 Bus 32:20-22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:1-38">Isa 37:1-38</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omugabe Hezekia ku yaabihuriire, yaataagura ebijwaro bye, yaajwara ekiguniya, yaaza omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Yaatuma Eliakimu omukuru w'ekikaari na Shebuna omuhandiiki n'abanyamurwa abakuru ahari nabi Isaaya mwene Amozi bajwaire ebiguniya. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Baamugira bati: Oku nikwo Hezekia arikugamba naagira ati: Eri izooba n'eizooba ry'obusaasi n'okuhanwa n'okuteererwa enaku, ahakuba abaana bahikire kuzaarwa, kwonka amaani g'okubazaara tigariho. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:35">2 Bag 18:35</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 19:16">19:16</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 16:12">2 Sam 16:12</ref>. </char></note> Shana MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe ahuriire ebigambo byona ebigambirwe Rabushaake, ou mukama we omugabe wa Asiria atumire kugaya Ruhanga otahwaho, obundi MUKAMA Ruhanga waawe akaamuhana ahabw'ebigambo ebyo ebi ahuriire; na'ahabw'ekyo imutsya eiraka ryawe oshabire abantu abakiriho abaahonokireho. <verse eid="2KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Abaheereza b'omugabe Hezekia ku baahikire owa Isaaya, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:17">2 Bag 18:17</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:22-25">22-25</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:30-35">30-35</ref>. </char></note> Isaaya yaabagira ati: Mugambire mukama waanyu muti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Otatiina ebyo bigambo bi ohuriire, ebi abaheereza b'omugabe wa Asiria banjumire. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:3">2 Bag 19:3</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, niinyija kumutamu ogundi mutima, ahurire orukuru, agarukye omu nsi ye; kandi ku araahikyeyo, mmwitse rurara.<verse eid="2KI 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Bwanyima Rabushaake yaagarukayo, yaashanga omugabe wa Asiria naarwanisa Libuna; ahabw'okuba akaba ahuriire ku arugire Lakishi. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebya Tiruhaaka omugabe wa Esiopia nibagira ngu, Reeba aizire kukuteera, yaagaruka yaatuma ahari Hezekia naagira ati: <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:5">2 Bag 18:5</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 18:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Mwirooko mugire Hezekia omugabe wa Yuda muti: Otaikiriza Ruhanga waawe ogwo ou orikwesiga kukubeiha naakuraganisa ati: Yerusaalemu teriheebwayo mu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Reeba, ohuriire oku abagabe ba Asiria baagizire ensi zoona, bakazicwekyerereza kimwe. Noogira ngu niiwe orikwija kukira? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:33">2 Bag 18:33</ref>. </char></note> Amahanga aga, Gozani, Harani, Rezefu, n'ab'omuri Edeni abaabaire batwire Telasaari, agu baatatenkuru baacwekyereize, noogira ngu baaruhanga baago bakagajuna? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:34">2 Bag 18:34</ref>. </char></note> Nyoreka omugabe wa Hamasi, n'owa Arupaadi, n'ow'orurembo Sefavaimu, n'owa Hena, n'owa Iiva!<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:17">2 Bus 32:17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hezekia yaayakiira ebaruha eyaareetwa ezo ntumwa, yaagishoma; bwanyima yainamuka, yaija omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaagishashaanura omu maisho ge. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 25:22">Kur 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:39">1 Bag 18:39</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 9:6">Neh 9:6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 86:10">Zab 86:10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 37:16">Isa 37:16</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 37:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 44:6">44:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 10:10">Yer 10:10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 10:12">12</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia yaashabira omu maisho ga MUKAMA naagira ati: Ai MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, otuura aha kitebe ky'obukama ahagati ya baakerubi, Iwe wenka niiwe Ruhanga ow'obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi; niiwe waahangire eiguru n'ensi. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 6:40">2 Bus 6:40</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 31:2">Zab 31:2</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:2">71:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:18">Dan 9:18</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA, tega okutu kwawe, ohurire; igura amaisho gaawe, ai MUKAMA, oreebe; ohurire ebigambo ebi Senakeribu atumire kurogota ahari Ruhanga otahwaho. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />N'ekya buzima, MUKAMA, abagabe ba Asiria bakacwekyereza abantu b'ago mahanga n'ensi zaabo, <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:19">2 Bus 32:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 115:4">Zab 115:4</ref>. </char></note> baanaga baaruhanga baabo omu muriro, ahabw'okuba bakaba batari baaruhanga nyamuhanga, kureka bakaba bakozirwe engaro z'abantu omu biti n'omu mabaare; nikyo baabacwekyerereize. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 4:24">Yos 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 83:18">Zab 83:18</ref>. </char></note> N'ahabw'ekyo hati, ai MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu, ninkweshengyereza otujune, otwihe omu mikono ye, obugabe bwona obw'omu nsi, ai MUKAMA, bumanye ku niiwe wenka oba Ruhanga.<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Isaaya okuragura ebiriba aha mugabe wa Asiria</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Bwanyima Isaaya mwene Amozi yaatuma ahari Hezekia naagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Nk'oku onshabire kukuhwera aha bya Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria, naakwikiriza. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Eki nikyo kigambo eki MUKAMA amugambireho naagira ati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Omwishiki wa Saayuuni otakamanyaga mushaija</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Naakugaya, naakushekyerera;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:21">Kandi Yerusaalemu neekuzongoreza omutwe.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:4-6">2 Bag 19:4-6</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 71:22">Zab 71:22</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 5:24">Isa 5:24</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 60:9">60:9</ref>; <ref loc="JER 51:5">Yer 51:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'oha ou ojumire, okarogotaho?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">Kandi ou okabukiire, okateera ekitsyori n'oha?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:22">N'Orikwera wa Israeli!<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:23: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 18:17">2 Bag 18:17</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 20:7">Zab 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:18">Isa 10:18</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ojumiise MUKAMA entumwa zaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Noogira oti: Nyinamukire n'ebigaari byangye bingi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Aha mitwe y'enshozi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Hare munonga ahagati ya Lebanooni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Niinyija kutema emyereezi yaayo emiraingwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">N'emiberooshi yaayo emirungi munonga;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Niinyija kuhika omu bweshereko bwayo hare munonga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:23">Omu kibira kyayo ekikwataine.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 19:6">Isa 19:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nkatimba amaziba g'abanyamahanga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Naanywa amaizi gaago;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Naaribatiirira emigyera ya Misiri yoona,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:24">Naagyomya.<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:25: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 10:5">Isa 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 45:7">45:7</ref>. </char>
    </note> Torahuriire ku naamaririire ira kukikora?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Omu biro bya ira nkacuma enaama y'okukora</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Ebi ndikuhikiiriza omu biro ebi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Ngu ocwekyereze endembo ezeehinguririziibwe engo z'amabaare,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:25">Ozihindure amatongo.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 129:6">Zab 129:6</ref>. </char>
    </note> Nikyo kyareeteire abazitwiremu kucweka entegye,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bakahahaaza omutima, bakarimbagirirwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bakaba nk'obunyaatsi bw'omu ishwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Nk'obunyaatsi buto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Bakahotoka nk'obunyaatsi obumezire aha mutwe gw'enju,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:26">Nk'engano ezooma zitakakuzire.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Kwonka nimmanya emishutamire yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:27">Emihururire yaawe, n'emitabaarukire yaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:27">Kandi n'ekiniga eki wangiriire.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:28: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 19:33-36">2 Bag 19:33-36</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 41:2">Yob 41:2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:28">Isa 30:28</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 29:4">Ezk 29:4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 38:4">38:4</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 4:12">Amo 4:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ahabw'okungirira ekiniga,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">Kandi nkahurira eby'amaryo gaawe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">Niinyija kukuta eirobo ryangye omu nyindo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">N'ekyoma kyangye omu kanwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2KI 19:28">Nkugarure omuhanda ogwakureetsire.<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:29: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 20:8">2 Bag 20:8</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 20:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="1SA 2:34">1 Sam 2:34</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 7:1">Isa 7:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 7:14">14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 2:12">Luk 2:12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi aka karyakubeera akamanyiso; omu mwaka ogu nimwija kurya ebyemerize; omu gwa kabiri murye ebyemerize eby'emiragarika y'ebyo, bwanyima omu mwaka gwa kashatu muryabiba mugyeshe, mubyare emizaabibu, murye ebijuma byayo. <verse eid="2KI 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:22">2 Bus 32:22</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 32:23">23</ref>. </char></note> Abatsigaire aha b'enju ya Yuda abaahonokireho baryagaruka batsimbe emizi okuzimu, n'ahaiguru baane ebyana; <verse eid="2KI 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:31: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 9:7">Isa 9:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 10:20">10:20</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba omuri Yerusaalemu haryarugamu ekicweka ekiriba kitsigaireho, n'aha rushozi Saayuuni harugyeho omutwe gw'abahonokireho. Obweziriki bwa MUKAMA buryakihikiiriza.<verse eid="2KI 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Nikyo MUKAMA arikugambira aha mugabe wa Asiria naagira ati: Tarihika muri oru rurembo, nari okurwemurikira omu maisho aine engabo ye, n'obu kwakuba okurutuumaho omutuumo gw'eitaka. <verse eid="2KI 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:28">2 Bag 19:28</ref>. </char></note> Omuhanda ogwamureetsire nigwo gurimugarurayo; kandi taritaaha muri oru rurembo; nikwo MUKAMA arikugira; <verse eid="2KI 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 11:13">1 Bag 11:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:6">2 Bag 20:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 31:5">Isa 31:5</ref>. </char></note> ahakuba ndyarinda oru rurembo, ndujune ahabwangye, n'ahabw'omwiru wangye Daudi.<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okucwekyerera kw'engabo za Senakeribu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">19:35: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:23">Kur 12:23</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 24:16">2 Sam 24:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Ekyo kiro maraika wa MUKAMA yaija, yaateera orusiisira rw'Abaasiria, yaitamu engabo z'Abaasiria akasiriira n'obukumi munaana n'enkumi itaano. Abantu ku baimukire omu kasheeshe, baashanga ezo ngabo zoona ziri emitumbi. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Bwanyima Senakeribu omugabe wa Asiria yaarugayo, yaagaruka Nineeve, yaatuurayo. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:31">2 Bag 17:31</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 14:2">Ezk 14:2</ref>. </char></note> Ku yaabaire ari omuri nyaruju ya ruhanga we Nisirooki naamuramya, Adurameleki na Sharezeeri abatabani baija baamwitsa rurara, baacwa, baahungira omu nsi ya Araraati. Esari-hadooni omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okwongyerwaho emyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:1-11: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ISA 38:1-22">Isa 38:1-22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Hezekia akarwara, yaahika aha ncwamba za rufu. Nabi Isaaya mwene Amozi yaija ah'ari, yaamugira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Tebeekanisa eby'eka yaawe; ahabw'okuba noija kufa, tori w'okukira.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:24">2 Bus 32:24</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Ahonaaho Hezekia yaahinduka, yaareba ekisiika, yaashaba MUKAMA naagira ati: <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 8:61">1 Bag 8:61</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 5:19">Neh 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 13:14">13:14</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:22">22</ref>, <ref loc="NEH 13:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Ai MUKAMA, ninkweshengyereza, mbwenu ijuka oku ngyendeire omu maisho gaawe omu bwesigwa n'omutima oguhikire, ninkora ebi orikusiima. Yaarira munonga. <verse eid="2KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Kwonka Isaaya ku yaabaire atakashohoire kuruga omu kibuga ky'ahagati omu kikaari, ekigambo kya MUKAMA kyamwijaho nikigira kiti: <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:20">2 Bag 19:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 39:12">Zab 39:12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 65:2">65:2</ref>. </char></note> Garukayo, ogambire Hezekia omukuru w'abantu bangye oti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Daudi shwenkuru, arikugamba naagira ati: Naahurira okushaba kwawe, kandi naareeba n'amarira gaawe. Reeba, niinyija kukukiza; aha kiro kya kashatu oinamukye omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:34">2 Bag 19:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ndyayongyera aha biro byawe emyaka ikumi n'etaano. Ndyakujuna, iwe n'oru rurembo, omu mikono y'omugabe wa Asiria, kandi ndurinde ahabwangye, n'ahabw'omwiru wangye Daudi. <verse eid="2KI 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Isaaya yaagira ati: Mureete ekitongye ky'emitiini. Baakireeta, baakibatika aha kizimba eki yaabaire arwaire, yaakira.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Obwo Hezekia akaba yaabuurize Isaaya ati: Ni kamanyiso ki akarikworeka ku MUKAMA arikwija kuntambira, kandi ku ndikwija kwinamuka omu nju ya MUKAMA aha kiro kya kashatu? <verse eid="2KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 19:29">2 Bag 19:29</ref>. </char></note> Isaaya yaamugarukamu ati: Aka niko kamanyiso aku MUKAMA yaakuha, akarikuhamya ku arikwija kuhikiiriza eki yaagamba. Nooyenda ngu ekicuucu kigyende omu maisho entambwe ikumi, nari kigarukye enyima entambwe ikumi? <verse eid="2KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 102:11">Zab 102:11</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia yaamugarukamu ati: Nikirahuka ekicuucu kugyenda omu maisho entambwe ikumi; haakiri kigarukye enyima ezo ntambwe ikumi. <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOS 10:12">Yos 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:1-8">Isa 39:1-8</ref>. </char></note> Atyo nabi Isaaya yaashaba MUKAMA; nawe yaagarura ekicuucu enyima entambwe ikumi okuruga ahu kyabaire kyahika aha ky'okugyeresa kya Ahazi.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hezekia okworeka entumwa za Babulooni obutungi bwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:31">2 Bus 32:31</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu biro ebyo Merodaakibaladaani mwene Baladaani omugabe wa Babulooni akatuma ahari Hezekia entumwa, zaamutwarira ebaruha n'ekiconco, ahabw'okuba akaba ahuriire ngu arwaire. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:27">2 Bus 32:27</ref>. </char></note> Hezekia yaazaakiira n'okushemererwa, yaazooreka enju ye yoona omu abiika ebintu bye eby'obuguzi bwingi, efeeza, ezaabu, emigaju, amajuta ag'obuguzi bwingi, n'ahu abiika eby'okurwanisa bye, n'ebyashangirwe omu mabiikiro ge byona; tihariho kintu kyona omu nju ye nari omu bugabe bwe bwona, eki atarazoorekire. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Bwanyima nabi Isaaya yaija aha mugabe Hezekia, yaamugira ati: Abashaija abo bagambire ki? Kandi baizire owaawe nibaruga hi? Hezekia yaagira ati: Barugire omu nsi ya hare Babulooni. <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Onu ati: Bareebire ki omwawe? Hezekia yaagira ati: Byona ebiri omwangye babireebire; tihariho kintu kyona omu mabiikiro gangye eki ntaboorekire.<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Isaaya yaagira Hezekia ati: Mbwenu hurira ekigambo kya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:13">2 Bag 24:13</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:13">25:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:5">Yer 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:19-22">27:19-22</ref>. </char></note> Reeba, obunaku buryahika, ebintu by'omu nju yaawe byona, n'ebi baashwenkuru baabiikire okuhitsya hati, bitwarwe Babulooni, harekye kugira ekyatsigaraho, nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:12">2 Bag 24:12</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 33:11">2 Bus 33:11</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:3">Dan 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi bamwe ahari batabani baawe, abu oriba oyezaariire, baryatwarwa, bahindukye abakonwa omu kikaari ky'omugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="2KI 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:25">2 Bus 32:25</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 32:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaagira Isaaya ati: Ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki waagamba ni kirungi. Ahakuba akagira ati: Mbwenu shi ti kirungi, ku haraabe nihaija kubaho obusingye n'obuhooro omu biro byangye?<verse eid="2KI 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:20: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 32:30">2 Bus 32:30</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 32:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 22:9">Isa 22:9</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 22:11">11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Hezekia n'eby'amaani ge goona n'oku yaakozire ekiyanja, akateera omukura gw'okureeta amaizi omu rurembo, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'Abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 32:33">2 Bus 32:33</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Hezekia yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru; Manaase omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Manaase</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:1-9: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 33:1-9">2 Bus 33:1-9</ref>. </char>
    </note> Manaase akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka ikumi n'ebiri, yaamara aha ngoma emyaka makumi ataano n'etaano naategyekyera Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Hefuziba. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 16:3">2 Bag 16:3</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, naatooreza emicwe erikunugwa ey'abanyamahanga, abu MUKAMA yaabingire omu maisho g'Abaisraeli; <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:16">2 Bag 17:16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:4">18:4</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:5">23:5</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 16:32">1 Bag 16:32</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 16:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 4:19">Bir 4:19</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okuba akagaruka yaayombeka zaanyaruju z'omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, ezi Hezekia ishe yaabaire asheenyire; yaayombekyera Baali amatambiro, yaakora Ashera nk'oku Ahabu omugabe wa Israeli yaabaire akora, kandi yaaguma naaramya eihe ryona ery'omu iguru, naariheereza. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:11">Bir 12:11</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 7:13">2 Sam 7:13</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:29">1 Bag 8:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 9:3">9:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:27">2 Bag 23:27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:30">Yer 7:30</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:34">32:34</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaayombeka amatambiro omu nju ya MUKAMA, ei MUKAMA yaabaire agambireho ati: Omuri Yerusaalemu nimwo ndita eiziina ryangye. <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 6:36">1 Bag 6:36</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:12">7:12</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:12">2 Bag 23:12</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaayombekyera eihe ryona ery'omu iguru amatambiro omu bikaari byombi eby'enju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:26">19:26</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 19:31">31</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 17:17">2 Bag 17:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:24">23:24</ref>. </char></note> Yaarabya omutabani omu muriro, yaaguma naakora eby'okumanyisa ebiribaho n'okuragura, kandi yaaraguza aha barikugambisa emizimu n'abarogi. Yaakora ebibi bingi omu maisho ga MUKAMA, yaamugwisa kubi. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Yaata ekishushani kya Ashera ekibaizire omu nju ei MUKAMA yaagambiire Daudi n'omutabani Sulemaani ati: Omu nju egi n'omuri Yerusaalemu ebi naatooraine omu nganda zoona eza Israeli, nimwo ndita eiziina ryangye kugumamu ebiro byona; <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 7:10">2 Sam 7:10</ref>. </char></note> kandi Abaisraeli ku barita omutima aha kworobera ebi naabaragiire byona, n'ebi omwiru wangye Musa yaabaragiire, tindigaruka kubazengyereza kubaiha omu nsi ei naahaire baishenkurubo. <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Kwonka tibaahurira, kandi Manaase yaababeihabeiha kukora ebibi ebirikukira obubi ebi amahanga gaakozire, agu MUKAMA yaacwekyerereize omu maisho g'Abaisraeli.<verse eid="2KI 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Bwanyima MUKAMA yaagamba naaraba omu bairu be baanabi ati: <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 21:26">1 Bag 21:26</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:2">2 Bag 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:3">24:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:4">Yer 15:4</ref>. </char></note> Ahabwa Manaase omugabe wa Yuda kukora ebirikunugwa ebyo, akakora ebibi ebirikukira obubi ebi Abaamori abaamubandiize baakozire byona, akasiisisa Abayuda ebishushani bye ebirikuramibwa; <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 3:11">1 Sam 3:11</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:3">Yer 19:3</ref>. </char></note> nikyo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugambira naagira ati: Reeba, naaza kureeta akabi ahari Yerusaalemu na Yuda, aku omuntu weena araahurire, amatu gakateera enduuru. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 28:17">Isa 28:17</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:11">34:11</ref>; <ref loc="LAM 2:8">Tonz 2:8</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 7:7">Amo 7:7</ref>, <ref loc="AMO 7:8">8</ref>. </char></note> Ndyagyeresa Yerusaalemu akagoye nk'aku naagyereise Samaria, na kariisho ei naashwijumiise enju ya Ahabu; kandi ndyaragaza Yerusaalemu, nk'oku omuntu aragaza esohaani, akagijuumika. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Ndyanaga ekicweka ekitsigaire aha buhunguzi bwangye, mbaheyo omu mikono y'abazigu baabo, bahindukye omuhiigo n'omunyago aharibo, <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />ahakuba bakozire ebi ndikwanga, bangwisa kubi okwiha obu baishenkurubo baaruga Misri n'okuhitsya hati.<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">21:16: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:11">2 Bag 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:4">24:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Manaase akasheesha eshagama nyingi y'abataine rubanja, okuhitsya obu yaijwize Yerusaalemu okuruga aha rubaju okuhika aha rundi, akabyongyera aha kibi eki yaasiisiise Abayuda, bakakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:11-19">2 Bus 33:11-19</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Manaase, n'ebi yaakozire byona, n'ekibi eki yaakozire, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:18-24: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 33:20-25">2 Bus 33:20-25</ref>. </char></note> Manaase yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, yaaziikwa omu musiri gw'aha nju ye, ogwa Uzza; Amoni omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Amoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amoni akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'ebiri, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera emyaka ebiri omuri Yerusaalemu, Nyina akaba naayetwa Meshulemeesi, muhara wa Haruzi owa Yotiba. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:2">2 Bag 21:2</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:6">6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:11">11</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA nka Manaase ishe. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Yaagyendera omu muhanda gwona ogu ishe yaagyendeiremu, yaaheereza ebishushani ebi ishe yaaheereize, kandi yaabiramya; <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:17">2 Bag 22:17</ref>. </char></note> yaimuura MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa baishenkuru, tiyaagyendera mu mihanda ye. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Bwanyima abaheereza b'omugabe Amoni baamugirira enaama, baamwitira omu nju ye. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Kwonka abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baita abamugiriire enaama boona, baata omutabani Yosia aha ngoma omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Amoni ei yaakozire, tehandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Yaaziikwa omu kituuro kye omu musiri gwa Uzza; Yosia omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 34:1">2 Bus 34:1</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 34:2">2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yosia akaba aine emyaka munaana, obu yaatandika kutegyeka; yaategyekyera emyaka makumi ashatu na gumwe omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Yedida, muhara wa Adaaya owa Bozikaasi. <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 5:32">Bir 5:32</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikusiimwa MUKAMA naagyendera omu muhanda gwa Daudi ishenkuru, tiyaateishuka kutoora aha rubaju rwa buryo nari rwa bumosho.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana gw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Yosia, aktuma Shafani mwene Azaliya mwijukuru wa Meshulaamu omuhandiiki, omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaamugira ati: <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:4">2 Bag 12:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 12:9">9</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 12:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Inamuka oze owa Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru, omugambire abare empiiha ezireetsirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA, ezi abarinzi b'eirembo bashoroize omu bantu, <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:11-14">2 Bag 12:11-14</ref>. </char></note> bazihe abarikureeberera enju ya MUKAMA, nabo bazihe abakozi abari omu nju ya MUKAMA abarikugihunduura ahi esiisikaire, <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />nibo babaizi, abombeki n'abarikwombekyesa amabaare; kandi ezindi zibe ez'okugura embaaho n'amabaare agahigwire eby'okuhunduuza enju. <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 12:15">2 Bag 12:15</ref>. </char></note> Kandi ezo mpiiha ezi baabaire babaha, bakaba batababuuza oku zikoresiibwe; ahabw'okuba bakaba bazikoresa n'obwesigwa.<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hilukia omunyamurwa okuzoora ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 34:14">2 Bus 34:14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:24-26">Bir 31:24-26</ref>. </char>
    </note> Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru yaagira Shafani omuhandiiki ati: Naazoora ekitabo ky'Ebiragiro omu nju ya MUKAMA. Atyo Hilukia yaaha Shafani ekyo kitabo, yaakishoma. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Bwanyima Shafani omuhandiiki yaija ow'omugabe, yaamugambira ati: Abairu baawe baihire omu nju ya MUKAMA empiiha ezishangirwemu; baaziha abarikugireeberera. <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Shafani omuhandiiki yaagaruka yaagira omugabe ati: Hilukia omunyamurwa yampa ekitabo. Atyo Shafani yaakimushomera. <verse eid="2KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Omugabe ku yaahuriire ebigambo by'omu kitabo ky'Ebiragiro, yaataagura ebijwaro bye. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:22">2 Bag 25:22</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:20">2 Bus 34:20</ref>; <ref loc="JER 26:24">Yer 26:24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:14">39:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:5">40:5</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho yaaragiira Hilukia omunyamurwa, Ahikaamu mwene Shafani, Akiboora mwene Mikaaya, Shafani omuhandiiki na Asaaya omugaragwa w'omugabe, naagira ati: <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 29:27">Bir 29:27</ref>. </char></note> Mwirooko muhanuuze ahari MUKAMA ahabwangye n'abantu bangye kandi na Yuda yoona eby'ebigambo by'ekitabo eki ekizoirwe; ahakuba ekiniga kya Ruhanga ekituriho ni kingi munonga, ahabw'okuba baatatenkuriitwe tibaroorobeire bigambo by'eki kitabo, okukora ebyahandiikirwe byona ebirikutukwataho.<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">22:14: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 34:22">2 Bus 34:22</ref>. </char>
    </note> Atyo Hilukia omunyamurwa, Ahikaamu, Akiboora, Shafani na Asaaya baaza owa Hulida nabikazi muka Shalumu mwene Tikuva, mwijukuru wa Harihaasi, omubiiki w'ebijwaro; (omu biro ebyo ogwo mukazi akaba atwire Yerusaalemu omu kicweka kyayo kya kabiri) baagamba nawe. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Yaabagira ati: Oku nikwo MUKAMA, Ruhanga wa Israeli, arikugamba naagira ati: Mugambire omushaija obantumireho muti: <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />Oku nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba naagira ati: Reeba, ndyareeta akabi aha mwanya ogu n'aha batuuzi baamwo, nk'ebigambo byona ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki omugabe wa Yuda ashomire oku biri. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:22">2 Bag 21:22</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 29:25">Bir 29:25</ref>, <ref loc="DEU 29:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Ahabw'okuba bakanyimuura, baayoterera baaruhanga abandi obubaane, ngu bangwise kubi n'ebi baakozire n'emikono yaabo byona, n'ahabw'ekyo ekiniga kyangye kiryayaka aha mwanya ogu, kandi tikiriraazibwa. <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Kwonka omugabe wa Yuda obatumire kuhanuuza ahari MUKAMA, mumugire muti: Oku nikwo MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli arikugamba naagira ati: Ebirikukwata aha bigambo ebi ohuriire, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:31">Lev 26:31</ref>, <ref loc="LEV 26:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 21:29">1 Bag 21:29</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 29:8">2 Bus 29:8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 30:7">30:7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:9">Yer 25:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:18">18</ref>; <ref loc="JER 44:22">44:22</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 6:16">Mik 6:16</ref>. </char></note> ahabw'okugira omutima gworobi, ku ohuriire ebi ngambire aha mwanya ogu n'aha batuuzi baamwo, ku barihinduka amatongo n'omukyeeno, waayecureeza omu maisho ga MUKAMA, waataagura ebijwaro byawe, waaririra omu maisho gangye, n'ahabw'ekyo naanye nkuhuriire; nikwo MUKAMA arikugamba. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 37:37">Zab 37:37</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 57:1">Isa 57:1</ref>, <ref loc="ISA 57:2">2</ref>. </char></note> Reeba nikyo ndikusaangisiza baashwenkuru, okaziikwa omu kituuro kyawe n'obusingye, kandi amaisho gaawe tigarireeba kabi koona aku ndireeta aha mwanya ogu. Batyo baagaruka, baabiteekyerereza omugabe.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s1">Yosia okurwanisa eby'obukafiiri, n'okugarura abantu ahari Ruhanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:1-3: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 34:29-32">2 Bus 34:29-32</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaatuma, abakuru ba Yuda n'aba Yerusaalemu boona baateeranira ah'ari. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 22:8">2 Bag 22:8</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 31:11">Bir 31:11</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yainamuka omu nju ya MUKAMA hamwe n'abashaija b'omuri Yuda boona, abatuuzi b'omuri Yerusaalemu boona, abanyamurwa, na baanabi, abantu boona abakuru n'abato; yaabashomera ebigambo byona eby'omu kitabo ky'endagaano ekizoirwe omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 11:14">2 Bag 11:14</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 11:17">17</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 13:4">Bir 13:4</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaayemerera aha rubaju rw'enyomyo, yaaragaana endagaano omu maisho ga MUKAMA, naaraganisa ku mukuratira, okworobera ebiragiro bye, n'ebi yaahamize, n'ebi yaataireho, n'omutima gwe gwona n'amagara ge goona, kandi n'okuhikiiriza ebigambo by'omuri egyo ndagaano ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo ekyo; n'abantu boona baakwatanisa nawe omuri egyo ndagaano.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:4: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:3">2 Bag 21:3</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:18">25:18</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:21">Bir 16:21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:24">Yer 52:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaragiira Hilukia omunyamurwa omukuru, n'abanyamurwa abarikukurataho, kandi n'abarinzi b'eirembo, kwiha omu nju ya MUKAMA ebintu byona ebyakoreirwe Baali na Ashera n'eihe ryona ery'omu iguru; yaabyokyeza aheeru ya Yerusaalemu omu kahanga ka Kidirooni, eiju ryabyo yaaritwara Beseeli. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Yaabinga abanyamurwa b'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa ebyatairweho abagabe ba Yuda kuguma nibabyoterera obubaane omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu ey'omu ndembo za Yuda n'eyeehinguririize Yerusaalemu; kandi yaabinga n'abandi abaabaire nibooterera Baali obubaane, n'eizooba n'okwezi n'eigana ry'enyonyoozi n'eihe ryona ery'omu iguru. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 15:16">2 Bus 15:16</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:4">34:4</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaiha Ashera omu nju ya MUKAMA, yaagitwara aheeru ya Yerusaalemu aha kagyera Kidirooni, yaagyokyezaho, yaagihondahonda, yaagicwa omucuucu, ogwo mucuucu yaagushuka aha bituuro by'abantu b'obutoosha. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 14:24">1 Bag 14:24</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 15:12">15:12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 16:16">Ezk 16:16</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaasheenya amaju ga baamaraya agaabaire gari omu nju ya MUKAMA, ahu abakazi baabaire barukira enyegamo z'okukingira Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Yaiha abanyamurwa boona omu ndembo za Yuda, yaashiisha emyanya mikuru y'okuramizamu, ahu abanyamurwa baabaire booterera obubaane, okuruga Geeba okuhika Beeri sheba; yaasheenya zaanyaruju z'emyanya mikuru eyaabaire eri aha irembo ahu orikutaahira nooza omu nju ya Yoshua omukuru w'orurembo, emyanya egyo ekaba eri aha rubaju rwa bumosho rw'eryo irembo. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 44:10-14">Ezk 44:10-14</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka abanyamurwa b'emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu tibainamuka ha itambiro rya MUKAMA omuri Yerusaalemu, kureka baaguma nibariira emigaati etatumbisiibwe omuri bagyenzi baabo. <verse eid="2KI 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 18:21">Lev 18:21</ref>; <ref loc="JOS 15:8">Yos 15:8</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 30:33">Isa 30:33</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:31">Yer 7:31</ref>, <ref loc="JER 7:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:11-14">19:11-14</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaashiisha Tofesi ey'omu ruhanga rwa beene Hinoomu, ngu hatagira omuntu weena owaarabya omutabani nari muhara we omu muriro kumutambira Moleki. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Yaihaho ebishushani by'embaraasi, ebi abagabe ba Yuda baabaire bahongyeire eizooba, ebyabaire biri ahu orikutaahira nooza omu nju ya MUKAMA, haihi n'ekishengye kya Nasani-meleki omukuru w'enju ekyabaire kihereraine na hekalu; yaayotsya n'ebigaari by'eizooba. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:5">2 Bag 21:5</ref>; <ref loc="JER 19:13">Yer 19:13</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:29">32:29</ref>; <ref loc="ZEP 1:5">Zef 1:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi amatambiro agaabaire gari aha mutwe gw'ekishengye kya Ahazi eki abagabe ba Yuda baayombekire, n'amatambiro agu Manaase yaabaire akozire omu bikaari bibiri eby'enju ya MUKAMA, yaagahanantura, yaagatuura ahansi, yaagasheenyagura, omucuucu gwago yaagunaga omu kagyera Kidirooni. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 21:29">Kub 21:29</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 11:5">1 Bag 11:5</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 11:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe yaashiisha emyanya mikuru ey'okuramizamu eyaabaire eri aha burugwa-izooba bwa Yerusaalemu, aha rubaju rwa buryo rw'akabungo k'eijundiro, ei Sulemaani omugabe wa Israeli yaabaire ayombekyeire Ashitaroosi ekirikunugwa ky'Abasidoni, na Kemoshi ekirikunugwa ky'Abamoabu, na Milikomu ekririkunugwa ky'Abaamoni. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 23:24">Kur 23:24</ref>. </char></note> Yaasheenyagura enyomyo, yaatema ebishushani bya Ashera, kandi omu myanya yaabyo yaijuzamu amagufa g'abantu.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosia okuhikiiriza ebyahanwirwe omu busingye bwa Yeroboamu mwene Nebati</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:15: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1KI 12:28">1 Bag 12:28</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:29">29</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 12:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 14:16">14:16</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi eitambiro rya Beseeli riri na nyaruju ey'omwanya mukuru ebi Yeroboamu mwene Nebati owaasiisiise Israeli yaabaire ayombekire, yaabikumbagaza, yaayatagura amabaare gaabyo, yaagacwa omucuucu; yaagaruka yaayotsya Ashera. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:2">1 Bag 13:2</ref>. </char></note> Yosia ku yaahindukire ati, yaareeba ebituuro hangahari aha kabungo; yaatuma, baiha amagufa omuri ebyo bituuro, yaagookyeza aha itambiro, yaarishiisha nk'ekigambo kya MUKAMA eki omushaija wa Ruhanga ori yaarangire naaragura oku kyabaire kiri. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:1">1 Bag 13:1</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 13:30">30</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaagira ati: Kiriya kiijutsyo eki ndikureeba obuseeri n'eky'enki? Abashaija b'omuri orwo rurembo baamugarukamu bati: N'ekituuro ky'omushaija wa Ruhanga owaarugire Yuda, akaragura ahari ebi ebi waakora eri itambiro. <verse eid="2KI 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 13:11">1 Bag 13:11</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 13:31">31</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe yaagira ati: Mumurekye; hatagira owaaziikuura amagufa ge. Batyo baareka amagufa ge hamwe n'aga nabi owaarugire Samaria. <verse eid="2KI 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 34:6">2 Bus 34:6</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 34:7">7</ref>. </char></note> Kandi zaanyaruju zoona ez'omu myanya mikuru y'okuramizamu ey'omu ndembo za Samaria, ezaabaire zombekirwe abagabe ba Israeli nibagwisa kubi MUKAMA, Yosia yaazigira nk'ebi yaagizire nyaruju ya Beseeli byona oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 22:20">Kur 22:20</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:40">1 Bag 18:40</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 11:18">2 Bag 11:18</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 34:5">2 Bus 34:5</ref>. </char></note> Kandi abanyamurwa b'egyo myanya mikuru boona abaabaire bariyo, yaabaitira aha matambiro, yaayokyezaho n'amagufa g'abantu. Bwanyima yaagaruka Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yosia okugaruraho obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="EXO 12:3-11">Kur 12:3-11</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 23:5-8">Lev 23:5-8</ref>; <ref loc="NUM 9:2-4">Kub 9:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 16:2-8">Bir 16:2-8</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:1-17">2 Bus 35:1-17</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima omugabe yaaragiira abantu boona ati: Mukorere MUKAMA Ruhanga waanyu obugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho, nk'oku kihandiikirwe omuri eki kitabo ky'endagaano. <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:22: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 35:18">2 Bus 35:18</ref>, <ref loc="2CH 35:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima okwiha omu biro by'abaramuzi abaabaire bacwera Abaisraeli emanja n'omu biro byona eby'abagabe ba Israeli n'aba Yuda; tihakabahoga bugyenyi bw'Okuhingurwaho oburikushusha nk'obwo; <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />kureka omu mwaka gwa ikumi na munaana ogw'omu busingye bw'omugabe Yosia nibwo baakorera MUKAMA obugyenyi obwo omuri Yerusaalemu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:24: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="GEN 31:19">Kut 31:19</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 19:31">Lev 19:31</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:27">20:27</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 18:11">Bir 18:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:6">2 Bag 21:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:11">11</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 22:8">22:8</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi Yosia yaihaho abarikugambisa emizimu n'abarogi, na baateraafi n'ebishushani ebirikuramibwa n'ebirikunugwa byona ebyashangirwe omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, ngu abone kuhikiiriza ebigambo by'Ebiragiro ebihandiikirwe omu kitabo eki Hilukia omunyamurwa yaazoire omu nju ya MUKAMA. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 18:5">2 Bag 18:5</ref>. </char></note> Omu bagabe boona abaamubandiize tihaine owaashushaine nawe, owaahindukiire MUKAMA n'omutima gwe gwona, n'amagara ge goona, n'amaani ge goona, nk'ebiragiro bya Musa byona oku biri; kandi n'omu baamukuratiire tihaine waashushaine nawe.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:26: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 21:11">2 Bag 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 24:3">24:3</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:4">4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 15:4">Yer 15:4</ref>. </char>
    </note> N'obu biraabe byabaire biri bityo MUKAMA tarahindukire kureka ekiniga kye kingi, eki yaagiriire Yuda, naabatura byona ebi Manaase yaakozire naamugwisa kubi. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:27: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 17:18-20">2 Bag 17:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 18:11">18:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 21:4">21:4</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 21:13">13</ref>. </char></note> Ekyarugiremu MUKAMA yaagira ati: Ndyaiha Abayuda omu maisho gangye, nk'oku naihiremu Abaisraeli, kandi nyogye oru rurembo Yerusaalemu oru naatooraine, n'enju ei naagizire nti: Nimwo eiziina ryangye ririguma.<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Okufa kwa Yosia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Nbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yosia n'ebi yaakozire byona, tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:29: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JDG 5:19">Bar 5:19</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 35:20-24">2 Bus 35:20-24</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:4">Yer 46:4</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 12:11">Zek 12:11</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omu busingye bwe Faraho Neeko omugabe wa Misri akainamuka aha mugyera Furaati kurwanisa omugabe wa Asiria; omugabe Yosia nawe yaaza kumurwanisa. Faraho Neeko ku yaamureebire, yaamwitira Megido. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30-34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:1-4">2 Bus 36:1-4</ref>. </char></note> Abaheereza be baiha omutumbi gwe Megido, baaguta omu kigaari, baagutwara Yerusaalemu, baamuziika omu kituuro kye. Abantu b'omuri egyo nsi baatwara Yehoahazi mwene Yosia, baamushukaho amajuta, baamwemeka omu mwanya gwa ishe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:28">2 Bag 9:28</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:31: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:18">2 Bag 24:18</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 3:15">1 Bus 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:11">Yer 22:11</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoahazi akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'eshatu, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera ameezi ashatu omuri Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Hamutaali muhara wa Yeremia owa Libuna. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:32: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:9">2 Bag 24:9</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi baishenkuru baakozire byona. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:33: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:6">2 Bag 25:6</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 25:21">21</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:5">Yer 39:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 39:6">6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:2">46:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:9">52:9</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:10">10</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:26">26</ref>, <ref loc="JER 52:27">27</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Faraho Neeko yaamubohera Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi, ngu arekye kuguma Yerusaalemu aha ngoma, n'abantu b'omuri egyo nsi yaabacwera omutoijo gw'etalanta z'efeeza igana, n'etalanta emwe y'ezaabu. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:34: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 22:11">Yer 22:11</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:12">12</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 19:3">Ezk 19:3</ref>, <ref loc="EZK 19:4">4</ref>. </char></note> Faraho Neeko yaagira Eliakimu mwene Yosia omugabe omu mwanya gwa ishe, yaahindura eiziina rye, yaamweta Yehoyakimu; kandi yaihayo Yehoahazi; Yehoahazi ogwo ku yaahikire Misri, yaagwayo. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Yehoyakimu yaaha Faraho ezo feeza n'ezaabu; kwonka yaacwera ensi omushoro, ngu bareete empiiha nk'ekiragiro kya Faraho oku kyabaire kiri. Yaashoroza efeeza n'ezaabu aha bantu b'omuri egyo nsi, buri muntu nk'oku yaabaire acwereirwe, kubiha Faraho Neeko.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">23:36: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:5">2 Bus 36:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakimu akaba aine emyaka makumi abiri n'etaano, obu yaatandika kutegyeka, yaategyekyera emyaka ikumi na gumwe Yerusaalemu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Zebida muhara wa Pedaaya owa Ruma. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:37: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:9">2 Bag 24:9</ref>, <ref loc="2KI 24:19">19</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA nk'ebi baishenkuru baakozire byona.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukadeneeza okusingura Abayuda n'okubatwara Babulooni bari enkwatwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:1: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:6">2 Bus 36:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 25:1">Yer 25:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 25:9">9</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:1">Dan 1:1</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu busingye bwa Yehoyakimu, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akainamuka, Yehoyakimu yaamwehongyera, yaamara emyaka eshatu ari omwiru we; bwanyima yaamuhinduka, yaamugomera. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:2: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:12-14">2 Bag 21:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:27">23:27</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 25:4">25:4</ref>; <ref loc="JER 35:11">Yer 35:11</ref>. </char></note> MUKAMA yaamwoherereza emitwe y'engabo z'Abakaludaaya, n'ez'Abasiria, n'ez'Abamoabu kandi n'ez'Abaamoni, ngu bateere Yuda bagicwekyereze, nk'oku MUKAMA yaagambire naaraba omu bairu be baanabi. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:11">2 Bag 21:11</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:26">23:26</ref>. </char></note> Buzimazima ekyo kikaba ahari Yuda ahabw'ekiragiro kya MUKAMA, ngu abone kubaiha omu maisho ge, naabatura ebibi bya Manaase nk'oku yaabikozire byona, <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 21:16">2 Bag 21:16</ref>. </char></note> kandi n'eshagama y'abataine rubanja ei yaaseesire; ahabw'okuba akagiijuza Yerusaalemu, na'ahabw'ekyo MUKAMA yaayanga kubimusaasira. <verse eid="2KI 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:5: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:8">2 Bus 36:8</ref>. </char></note> Mbwenu endiijo mirimo ya Yehoyakimu n'ebi yaakozire byona tibihandiikirwe omu kitabo ky'eby'omu busingye bw'abagabe ba Yuda? <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:6">2 Bus 36:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:18">Yer 22:18</ref>, <ref loc="JER 22:19">19</ref>; <ref loc="JER 36:30">36:30</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Yehoyakimu yaagwejegyera, yaashanga baishenkuru, Yehoyakiini omutabani yaategyeka omu mwanya gwe. <verse eid="2KI 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 37:5">Yer 37:5</ref>, <ref loc="JER 37:7">7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 46:2">46:2</ref>, <ref loc="JER 46:20">20</ref>, <ref loc="JER 46:24">24</ref>, <ref loc="JER 46:26">26</ref>. </char></note> Kandi omugabe wa Misri taragarukire kuruga mu nsi ye, ahakuba omugabe wa Babulooni akaba akubwire ensi yoona eyaabaire eri ey'omugabe wa Misri, okuruga aha kagyera ka Misri okuhika aha mugyera Furaati.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:8: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1CH 3:16">1 Bus 3:16</ref>; <ref loc="EST 2:6">Est 2:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 22:24">Yer 22:24</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakiini akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka ikumi na munaana, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu ameezi ashatu. Nyina akaba naayetwa Nehushiita, muhara wa Elinasani owa Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Naawe yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA, nk'ebi ishe yaakozire byona. <verse eid="2KI 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 1:1">Dan 1:1</ref>. </char></note> Omu biro ebyo abashaija ba Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni bakainamuka, baateera Yerusaalemu, baagota orurembo. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Bwanyima Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaijayo, abashaija be bakirugotsire. <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:27">2 Bag 25:27</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Bus 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="JER 24:1">Yer 24:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:1">29:1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:12">Ezk 17:12</ref>. </char></note> Yehoyakiini omugabe wa Yuda yaashohora, yaayehayo omu mikono y'omugabe wa Babulooni, we na nyina n'abagaragwa be n'abanyiginya be, n'abakuru b'ekikaari kye. Ogwo mugabe wa Babulooni omu mwaka gwe gwa munaana nibwo yaakwata Yehoyakiini, akamutwara ari enkwatwa, <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:48-50">1 Bag 7:48-50</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 20:17">2 Bag 20:17</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 36:7">2 Bus 36:7</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 1:7">Ezr 1:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 39:6">Isa 39:6</ref>; <ref loc="JER 20:5">Yer 20:5</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 1:2">Dan 1:2</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 5:2">5:2</ref>, <ref loc="DAN 5:3">3</ref>. </char></note> kandi yaanyaga eby'obutungi by'omu nju ya MUKAMA byona n'eby'omu nju y'omugabe, yaatematema ebintu by'ezaabu byona eby'omuri hekalu ya MUKAMA, ebi Sulemaani omugabe wa Israeli yaakozire, nk'oku MUKAMA yaabaire agambire. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 25:12">2 Bag 25:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:2">Yer 29:2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:28">52:28</ref>. </char></note> Kandi yaatwara ab'omuri Yerusaalemu boona bari enkwatwa n'abanyiginya boona, n'amamanzi goona ag'amaani; enkwatwa zoona hamwe n'abanyamyoga boona n'abaheesi zaaba kakumi; tihaagira owaatsigarayo, kureka abantu abarikuhereerukayo omu bworo bonka omuri egyo nsi. <verse eid="2KI 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:10">2 Bus 36:10</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:13">Ezk 17:13</ref>. </char></note> Atyo yaatwara Yehoyakiini Babulooni; na nyin'omugabe n'abakazi be n'abatware be n'abakuru b'ensi ye, yaabaiha Yerusaalemu, yaabatwara Babulooni bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Abashaija boona amamanzi enkumi mushanju, abanyamyoga hamwe n'abaheesi rukumi, boona ab'amaani abarikumanya eby'engamba, omugabe wa Babulooni yaabatwara Babulooni bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17-20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:10-13">2 Bus 36:10-13</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima yaata Matania, ishento wa Yehoyakiini, aha ngoma omu mwanya gwe, yaahindura eiziina rye, yaamweta Zedekia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 3:15">1 Bus 3:15</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:1">Yer 37:1</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Eby'omu busingye bwa Zedekia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">24:18—25:21 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 52:1-27">Yer 52:1-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Zedekia akaza aha ngoma aine emyaka makumi abiri na gumwe, yaategyekyera Yerusaalemu emyaka ikumi na gumwe. Nyina akaba naayetwa Hamutaali muhara wa Yeremia owa Libuna.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:21">2 Bag 23:21</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:37">2 Bag 23:37</ref>. </char></note> Yaakora ebirikwangwa MUKAMA nk'ebi Yehoyakiini yaakozire byona oku byabaire biri. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:20: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 17:18">Ezk 17:18</ref>. </char></note> Ahakuba ekiniga kya MUKAMA kikaba kingi munonga ahari Yerusaalemu na Yuda, okuhitsya obu yaababingiire kimwe omu maisho ge. Bwanyima Zedekia yaagomera omugabe wa Babulooni.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s1">Nebukadeneeza okugaruka kugota Yerusaalemu, n'okutwara abatsigairemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:1-7: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:17-20">2 Bus 36:17-20</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu mwaka gwa mwenda ogw'omu busingye bwa Zedekia omu kwezi kwa ikumi aha kiro kyakwo kya ikumi, Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni akaija n'eihe rye ryona kuteera Yerusaalemu, yaagigota; baagyombekaho eby'okugirwanisizaho okugyehinguririza.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:1: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 30:1-7">Yer 30:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 34:1">34:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 34:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:1">39:1</ref>, <ref loc="JER 39:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:4-11">52:4-11</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 21:22">Ezk 21:22</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 24:2">24:2</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 26:8">26:8</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Batyo baagota orwo rurembo okuhitsya omu mwaka gwa ikumi na gumwe ogw'omu busingye bwa Zedekia. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:3: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LAM 4:9">Tonz 4:9</ref>, <ref loc="LAM 4:10">10</ref>. </char></note> Aha kiro kya mwenda omu kwezi kwa kana enjara yaaba nyingi munonga omuri orwo rurembo, abantu baamwo baabura eky'okurya. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:4: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima Abakaludaaya baafumura orugo rw'orurembo. Ahonaaho omugabe Zedekia n'engabo ze zoona baacwa ekyo kiro, baaraba omu irembo eryabaire riri haihi n'omusiri gw'omugabe ahagati y'engo zaagwo zombi, baatoora ogurikuza Araba. (Obwo Abakaludaaya bagotsire orurembo embaju zoona). <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Kwonka eihe ry'Abakaludaaya ryakurata omugabe, ryamuhikira omu mpita za Yeriko, engabo ze zoona zaamuhungaho, zaataataana. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:6: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 23:23">2 Bag 23:23</ref>; <ref loc="JER 32:4">Yer 32:4</ref>. </char></note> Batyo baakwata ogwo mugabe, baamureetera omugabe wa Babulooni ahari Ribula, yaamucwera orubanja. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 12:13">Ezk 12:13</ref>. </char></note> Baitira batabani ba Zedekia ogwo omu maisho ge, bwanyima nawe baamwihamu amaisho, baamukoma n'emihama, baamutwara Babulooni.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:8-12: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 39:8-12">Yer 39:8-12</ref>. </char>
    </note> Omu kwezi kwa kataano aha kiro kya mushanju ky'okwo kwezi, omu mwaka gwa ikumi na mwenda omu busingye bwa Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni, Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi, omushaija w'omugabe wa Babulooni, akaija Yerusaalemu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:8: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 52:12-16">Yer 52:12-16</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:19">2 Bus 36:19</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 79:1">Zab 79:1</ref>; <ref loc="HOS 8:14">Hos 8:14</ref>; <ref loc="AMO 2:5">Amo 2:5</ref>. </char></note> Yaayotsya enju ya MUKAMA n'enju y'omugabe n'amaju goona ag'omuri Yerusaalemu; buri nju yoona empango yaagyotsya. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:10: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NEH 1:3">Neh 1:3</ref>. </char></note> Eihe ryona ey'Abakaludaaya, abaizire n'omukuru w'abarinzi, baasheenya engo z'amabaare ezaabaire zeehinguririize Yerusaalemu. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:11: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2CH 36:20">2 Bus 36:20</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abantu abaabaire batsigaire omu rurembo, n'abaabaire baimwire omugabe waabo beehongyeire omugabe wa Babulooni, n'abandi bantu b'obutoosha, abo boona Nebuzaradaani omukuru w'abarinzi yaabatwara bari enkwatwa. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:12: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:14">2 Bag 24:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:7">Yer 40:7</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka yaatsigamu abantu bamwe abarikuhereerukayo kuba abooro kuguma nibasharira emizaabibu kandi n'ab'okuhinga.<verse eid="2KI 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:13-17: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2CH 36:18-20">2 Bus 36:18-20</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 7:15">1 Bag 7:15</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:23">23</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:27">27</ref>; <ref loc="JER 27:19">Yer 27:19</ref>, <ref loc="JER 27:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="JER 52:17-33">52:17-33</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi enyomyo z'emiringa ezaabaire ziri omu nju ya MUKAMA, n'ebitebe by'ebinaabiro n'ekitanka ky'emiringa ebyabaire biri omu nju ya MUKAMA, Abakaludaaya baabisheenyagura, baatwara emiringa yaabyo Babulooni. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:45">1 Bag 7:45</ref>, <ref loc="1KI 7:50">50</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 27:3">Kur 27:3</ref>. </char></note> Kandi baatwara enyungu n'ebyoma by'okuyooza eiju, na makansi, n'enyabya z'obubaane, n'ebindi bintu bye'miringa byona ebyabaire bikoresibwa omu murimo gwa hekalu, <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />n'eby'okuguhisa omuriro, n'enyabya. Ebintu ebyabaire bikozire omu zaabu omukuru w'abarinzi yaabitwara biri efeeza. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:16: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:47">1 Bag 7:47</ref>. </char></note> Enyomyo zombi ziri, n'ekitanka, n'ebitebe ebi Sulemaani yaakoreire enju ya MUKAMA, emiringa y'ebyo bintu byona ekaba erengire ekigyero. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:17: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1KI 7:15-18">1 Bag 7:15-18</ref>. </char></note> Obwemi bw'enyomyo emwe bukaba buri mikono ikumi na munaana, kandi eriho omutwe gw'emiringa, obwemi bwagwo mikono eshatu; omutwe ogwo gwehinguririziibwe otugoye tw'emiringa otushobeekaine nk'akatimba, n'ebishushani by'ebijuma by'amakomamahanga, byona biri eby'emiringa; kandi enyomyo ya kabiri ekaba eine nk'ebyo, nabyo biriho akatimba.<verse eid="2KI 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:18-21: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="JER 52:22-27">Yer 52:22-27</ref>. </char>
    </note> Bwanyima ogwo mukuru w'abarinzi yaakwata Seraaya omunyamurwa omukuru, na Zefania orikukurataho, n'abarinzi b'eirembo bonshatu;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CH 6:14">1 Bus 6:14</ref>; <ref loc="EZR 7:1">Ezr 7:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 21:1">Yer 21:1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 29:25">29:25</ref>; <ref loc="JER 37:3">37:3</ref>. </char></note> <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />kandi omu rurembo yaihamu omutware owaabaire ari omukuru w'engabo, n'abashaija bataano abaabaire bari bamwe aha bashaija empikamugabe abaashangirwe omu rurembo, n'omuhandiiki w'omukuru w'eihe, owaabaire ahuruza engabo z'omuri egyo nsi, n'abashaija makumi mukaaga b'omu bantu b'obutoosha abaashangirwe omu rurembo. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Atyo Nebuzaradaani ogwo, omukuru w'abarinzi, yaabakukumba, yaabatwara Ribula aha mugabe wa Babulooni. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:21: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 26:33">Lev 26:33</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 28:64">Bir 28:64</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 23:27">2 Bag 23:27</ref>. </char></note> Omugabe wa Babulooni yaabateera, yaabaitira Ribula omu nsi ya Hamasi. Okwo nikwo Abayuda baihirwe omu nsi yaabo, bakatwarwa bari enkwatwa.<verse eid="2KI 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:22: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 22:12">2 Bag 22:12</ref>; <ref loc="JER 39:14">Yer 39:14</ref>; <ref loc="JER 40:5">40:5</ref>. </char>
    </note> Kandi abantu abaatsigaire omu nsi ya Yuda, abu Nebukadeneeza omugabe wa Babulooni yaatisigiremu, yaataho Gedalia mwene Ahikaamu, mwijukuru wa Shafani, kuba omutegyeki waabo. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:23: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 40:7-9">Yer 40:7-9</ref>. </char></note> Bwanyima abakuru b'engabo boona hamwe n'engabo zaabo, ku baahuriire ngu omugabe wa Babulooni ataireho Gedalia kuba omutegyeki, baija Mizipa, ahu yaabaire ari n'engabo zaabo; haija Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, Yohanaani mwene Yanihumeesi owa Netofa, na Yazania mutabani w'omushaija wa Maaka. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedalia yaabarahira n'abashaija baabo naagira ati: Mutatiina abakuru b'Abakaludaaya; mugume omuri egi nsi, mukorere omugabe wa Babulooni, nimwija kuba gye. <verse eid="2KI 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:25: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>. </char></note> Kwonka omu kwezi kwa mushanju Ishimaeli mwene Nesania, mwijukuru wa Elishaama ow'omuryango gw'omugabe, yaija n'abashaija ikumi, baarwanisa Gedalia, baamwita hamwe n'Abayudaaya n'Abakaludaaya, abu yaabaire aine Mizipa. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">25:26: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>. </char></note> Ahonaaho abantu boona, abakuru n'abato, n'abo bakuru b'engabo, baimuka, baahungira Misri ahabw'okutiina Abakaludaaya.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">25:27: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="2KI 24:2">2 Bag 24:2</ref>. </char>
    </note> Yehoyakiini omugabe wa Yuda ku yaabaire amazire emyaka makumi ashatu na mushanju ari omu bukwatwa, omu kwezi kwa ikumi n'abiri aha kiro kya makumi abiri na mushanju ky'okwo kwezi, omu mwaka ogu Evili-merodaaki omugabe wa Babulooni yaatandikiiremu kutegyeka, yaiha Yehoyakiini omu kihome, <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />yaagamba gye nawe, yaamuha ekitebe ekirikukira eby'abandi bagabe abaabaire bari hamwe nawe Babulooni. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Atyo Yehoyakiini yaajuura ebijwaro by'ekihome. Okuruga aho yaaguma naariira aha meeza y'omugabe ebiro bye byona; <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />kandi eby'okumutunga omugabe yaaguma naabimuha, buri izooba naamuha omugabo gwaryo, ebiro byona ebi yaamazire akihuriire.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>